ton></div></div><!--$--><div class="comments-wrapper" id="41245778-1b29-368e-b721-0ea52518308d-canvass"><a data-ylk="elm:cmmt_login;itc:0;slk:login;subsec:canvass;" class="text-px12 comment-login W(100%) border-divider-primary block rounded-sm border px-3 py-1.5 text-[#7d2eff] outline-none hover:underline" href="https://login.yahoo.com/?.intl=tw&amp;.lang=zh-Hant-TW&amp;.done=&amp;.src=news">登入後即可張貼留言。</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="h-5"></div></div><!--/$--></div></section><section class="mt-module-gap" id="module-coview"><div class="mb-[110px]" id="recommended-article-stream"><div class="flex flex-row flex-nowrap items-center mb-3"><div class="bg-brand-yahoo-purple mr-2 h-[20px] w-[8px] flex-none rounded-xs block"></div><h2 class="text-batcave flex-auto font-bold text-px20">其他人也在看</h2></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-nowrap"><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CF457F55D078D1C2646BC8B8FB2C164A2A5C6AA6B5EC34F499B989C184CE4950/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F55aab8f145b4e6a4938645bafcddcb1f.jpg"/><img alt="沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7B83FBE685E1756848E9C5854F7919040E9647DF4DC980AF32CE17D6FF4BEE8C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F55aab8f145b4e6a4938645bafcddcb1f.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;ffb46140-0af6-30ef-a120-e67ee3b4cfdd&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:1,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:1;ct:story;g:ffb46140-0af6-30ef-a120-e67ee3b4cfdd;slk:沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E6%BF%80%E6%88%B0-%E9%BB%83%E6%9A%90%E7%80%9A%E6%9B%9D-3%E8%80%85%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%8D-%E9%80%99%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF1128%E7%95%B6%E9%81%B8%E4%BA%BA-072223893.html">沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">即時中心／潘柏廷報導民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋，投入選戰以來，藉由掃街拜票、流利口才點出現今市政問題，再加上接受非同溫層的資深媒體人王偉忠等人專訪，逐漸在首都掀起「洋流」旋風；甚至在最新民調顯示，他與對手、國民黨籍市長蔣萬安僅差8%，引發各界高度關注。對此，資深媒體人黃暐瀚今（19）日在臉書指出，只要3者到位，沈伯洋將是11月28日的台北市長當選人。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 58 分鐘前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>3<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/BC813077BB6D70A662E2204FA875B1007D59E731CB6A6CA873C6C4E5028667B4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fstormmediagroup.com%2F27d3d539f373becba84201e3050354f5"/><img alt="「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FC9ED3D2B4770EC489E936EE5D4C8A0A6FF79F28733ADD263BE87CC9F8046D8B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fstormmediagroup.com%2F27d3d539f373becba84201e3050354f5"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;08c0c541-dec5-3520-99ca-33ad16f52d0d&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:3,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:3;ct:story;g:08c0c541-dec5-3520-99ca-33ad16f52d0d;slk:「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E8%81%B2%E5%8B%A2%E6%B5%A9%E5%A4%A7%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%A3%E7%A5%A8-%E9%86%AB%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80-%E7%B6%A0%E7%87%9F%E6%81%90-%E5%B1%8D%E5%A4%9A%E5%91%BD-060630845.html">「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">2026九合一選戰進入倒數階段，台北市長選情白熱化，民進黨參選人沈伯洋近來掃街、造勢所到之處人潮洶湧，被認為是「洋流崛起」。不過，胸腔科醫師蘇一峰在臉書發文表示，「洋流全台亂衝」無法轉化成選票，恐導致綠營「一屍多命」，新北市長參選人蘇巧慧成最大苦主。針對近來洋流崛起的討論，蘇一峰直言，洋流亂衝無法轉化為選票，綠營恐面臨一屍多命。洋流熱潮壓縮其他縣市綠營聲量，......</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">風傳媒 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>82<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3A78A7BFDB5C58E705E286A33316C5801FB889DF3B2053FAE8E5C394DCE00B3B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fupmedia.mg.tw%2F5c2ec9ff808c6488076a2e1e474f284f.jpg"/><img alt="薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E68A0A7488FFD5BFE91281F066DEC9DA4E3C4952E568B4794D7CB95C8AF72A82/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fupmedia.mg.tw%2F5c2ec9ff808c6488076a2e1e474f284f.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;c69fd3b9-07ec-315d-9cc0-7c5c47e4b082&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:4,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:4;ct:story;g:c69fd3b9-07ec-315d-9cc0-7c5c47e4b082;slk:薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E6%9C%80%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%B1%E5%9B%9B%E7%99%BC%E6%B5%B7%E8%AD%A6-%E5%8C%97%E8%BD%89%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91-%E5%88%863%E6%B4%BE-%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%8E%E9%98%B2%E9%A2%A8%E9%9B%A8-060600322.html">薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">今年第29號颱風「薔琵」（Champi）持續向台灣附近海域靠近。氣象粉專「台灣颱風論壇｜天氣特急」今（19日）指出，強颱薔琵在經歷眼牆置換與乾空氣捲入後，核心結構正重新建立，原本模糊</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">上報 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>14<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6FC15054AA14421FD3BB1756579CEF08763FDCC9A9B511154F7506EBD6454CAD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F119a96796437adcef46480f42243daa7.jpg"/><img alt="柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8D51E65174DB4968F233522C23AFCB590F1FEA1A159FE606E07B201911AE0C19/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F119a96796437adcef46480f42243daa7.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;1e797b2b-c2ec-3d2c-b029-b74ee603f49b&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:5,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:5;ct:story;g:1e797b2b-c2ec-3d2c-b029-b74ee603f49b;slk:柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9F%AF%E6%96%87%E5%93%B2%E5%AE%8C%E8%9B%8B%E4%BA%86-%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%B3%E6%88%BF%E6%9D%8E%E6%96%87%E5%AE%97%E8%AA%8D%E7%BD%AA%E8%88%87%E6%9F%AF%E6%8E%8F%E7%A9%BA%E7%9C%BE%E6%9C%9B%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E6%9C%83-070800907.html">柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">高等法院今（19日）針對民眾黨前主席柯文哲涉及侵佔政治獻及掏空眾望基金會案再度開庭，李文宗確定認罪，坦承與柯文哲挪用眾望基金會公款210萬元給柯文哲的貼身帳房許芷瑜（橘子、潛逃通緝中）、黃心緗等4個未到基金會工作，實際從事柯競選活動人員。此外李文娟也傳出有意認罪。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">鏡週刊Mirror Media ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>18<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/83BC3160EE4A0F9AFAF00239D9DC6D8D59EC4C91E2B9632FBE866F69E826022B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftnn_com_tw_939%2F33d1f95f70e12fa62cc0567f3f5ba2e6.jpg"/><img alt="洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/970D7FE0496867D62248E586959143D660794D658C816B9B0E3BC2EA2B12A1BA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftnn_com_tw_939%2F33d1f95f70e12fa62cc0567f3f5ba2e6.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;3133ced5-69b3-3881-9c0d-4a7404cd13eb&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:7,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:7;ct:story;g:3133ced5-69b3-3881-9c0d-4a7404cd13eb;slk:洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B%E7%8F%BE-%E8%AE%8A%E5%A4%A9%E7%9B%A4-%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E6%B0%91%E8%AA%BF%E6%98%8E%E5%85%AC%E5%B8%83-%E6%88%B4%E7%AB%8B%E5%AE%89%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80-%E4%BB%8D%E6%9C%89%E8%90%BD%E5%B7%AE-065800955.html">洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">[FTNN新聞網]記者胡家銘／台北報導九合一選戰倒數，台北市長選情成全國最熱焦點，爭取連任的台北市長蔣萬安市政爭議不斷，民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋以「洋...</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">FTNN新聞網 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>39<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/76F47705F6965C0372A87E88EDAF7501A9AEF58406EFEBE041E4A535B31090E6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F48e3bde343103c4c7c181eb7124d2d36.jpg"/><img alt="蘇姿丰父親驚喜現身！聽這段「沈伯洋狂憋淚」網看哭了" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B1FFCD30014BD347303DBDE81ECC3F8E85F8F29940A99EFBD2CAC08125D61A5C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F48e3bde343103c4c7c181eb7124d2d36.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;7016aa05-2539-3e46-a232-64a3ccfe05e6&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:8,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;蘇姿丰父親驚喜現身！聽這段「沈伯洋狂憋淚」網看哭了&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:8;ct:story;g:7016aa05-2539-3e46-a232-64a3ccfe05e6;slk:蘇姿丰父親驚喜現身！聽這段「沈伯洋狂憋淚」網看哭了;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="蘇姿丰父親驚喜現身！聽這段「沈伯洋狂憋淚」網看哭了" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%98%87%E5%A7%BF%E4%B8%B0%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E9%A9%9A%E5%96%9C%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB-%E8%81%BD%E9%80%99%E6%AE%B5-%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%8B%82%E6%86%8B%E6%B7%9A-%E7%B6%B2%E7%9C%8B%E5%93%AD%E4%BA%86-142114398.html">蘇姿丰父親驚喜現身！聽這段「沈伯洋狂憋淚」網看哭了</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">政治中心／周希雯報導九合一大選決戰日逼近，民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋帶著「台北大洋流號」，今（18日）第二站重磅來到「本命區」，前進松山、信義選區，並在終點站民權公園舉行造勢活動。沒想到除了行政院長卓榮泰親自到場力挺，超微（AMD）董事長暨執行長蘇姿丰的父親、總統府資政蘇春槐，更作為神秘來賓驚喜現身，在台上發言時滿懷溫情與期許，令沈伯洋多次望著他哽咽，許多看直播的網友也動容，「他在忍著不哭」</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 18 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>65<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D6A31826242793FC70E8965797412272288F98BBF1BEA211D747903ED1F3D39A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F915e0fad10c3a164b621626ee05ef190.png"/><img alt="最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手..." class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/92BE382674850A838109CD1FA065AF4C44846FFC79DC0B2A67A6E2B00F3AB513/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F915e0fad10c3a164b621626ee05ef190.png"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;9199b37c-74f9-3889-bba5-3cd5a77da3ec&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:9,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手...&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:9;ct:story;g:9199b37c-74f9-3889-bba5-3cd5a77da3ec;slk:最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手...;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手..." class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7%E9%81%B8%E6%88%B0%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E5%87%BA%E7%88%90-%E9%80%99%E4%BA%BA-%E9%A0%98%E5%85%88%E8%BF%91%E5%85%A9%E6%88%90%E7%A2%BE%E5%A3%93%E5%B0%8D%E6%89%8B-233436340.html">最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手...</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">[Newtalk新聞] 距離九合一選舉提票日剩四十日。其中，在台北市市長選戰部分，國民黨由現任市長蔣萬安拼連任；民進黨則由立委沈伯洋應戰。根據一項最新調查，「這人」竟近領先近兩成碾壓對手。 《壹蘋新聞網》近日發起以「倒數6週，你支持誰當台北市長？」為題之網路投票，投票時間為本月11日至16日止，共有5,045人參與。結果顯示，沈伯洋以56.1%居首；蔣萬安以41.5%居次；另有2.4%表示「尚未決定」。沈伯洋與蔣萬安兩人支持度相差14.7個百分點。 不過，網路投票涉及的不確定因素極多，至多只能作為觀察網友態度的參考，較難作為判斷實際選舉輿情的依據。若要關注相關選舉輿情變化，建議仍應參考各家民調機構、媒體民調中心，或委託專業民調機構所進行的民意調查。查看原文更多Newtalk新聞報導沈伯洋很氣「我是犯罪學所長」 蔣萬安：你專業是認知作戰 沈伯洋：我是「認知作戰」專家、但蔣萬安跟我應是同一國人</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">Newtalk新聞 ・ 8 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>122<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2F4FBC68EEDF4AB6C0934EB2157B941640EB42DC47776540F9337A9366A06E29/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnextapple_com_761%2F51c9320ea2d74f3d55727a92ff6996dc"/><img alt="沈伯洋「大洋流號」經民生社區　樓上有人潑水！警曝調查結果" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/488765CE489344591570AE6702E277EA7677B1D6DA359C946CC748C5682D7389/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnextapple_com_761%2F51c9320ea2d74f3d55727a92ff6996dc"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;8c7898fd-afc7-3ca1-8f97-e0faa1e7044a&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:11,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;沈伯洋「大洋流號」經民生社區　樓上有人潑水！警曝調查結果&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:11;ct:story;g:8c7898fd-afc7-3ca1-8f97-e0faa1e7044a;slk:沈伯洋「大洋流號」經民生社區　樓上有人潑水！警曝調查結果;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="沈伯洋「大洋流號」經民生社區　樓上有人潑水！警曝調查結果" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A4%A7%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E8%99%9F-%E7%B6%93%E6%B0%91%E7%94%9F%E7%A4%BE%E5%8D%80-%E6%A8%93%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%BD%91%E6%B0%B4-%E8%AD%A6%E6%9B%9D%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E7%B5%90%E6%9E%9C-075600778.html">沈伯洋「大洋流號」經民生社區　樓上有人潑水！警曝調查結果</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">【記者江孟謙／台北報導】民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋「大洋流號」昨天（18日）經過松山區民生社區，疑似有住戶從高樓灑水，被「小水滴」譏諷「真的是非常有水準」。轄區警方還原當時狀況以及處理情形。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">壹蘋新聞網 ・ 25 分鐘前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>4<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/040FA89B9E9B79E3C3ACDC6095C5143E123B3943953CD3D9D5ABA5DCFDFD0C9E/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F6c42e63403c0df12b7c31ad63e7f350e.jpg"/><img alt="深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A3BEB2B1C25296445C0E13D81A76B88B342E4A70B6BEF1F2E6399F4D9A0DA090/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F6c42e63403c0df12b7c31ad63e7f350e.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;a124ad9b-b2df-36bc-b7d9-78d7e5a2009c&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:12,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:12;ct:story;g:a124ad9b-b2df-36bc-b7d9-78d7e5a2009c;slk:深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B7%B1%E8%97%8D%E5%A4%96%E7%9C%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BB%A3-%E6%B1%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%94%B9%E6%8A%95%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E6%9B%9D1%E9%97%9C%E9%8D%B5-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E7%AB%9F%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E5%9B%9B%E7%8D%B8%E5%B1%B1-022800500.html">深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">2026台北市長選戰白熱化，尋求連任的蔣萬安與民進黨參選人沈伯洋競爭激烈。近日傳出深藍選區的外省第三代民眾「票投轉向」，表態改支持沈伯洋。該名民眾指出，主因在於蔣萬安先前竟答不出信義區著名的「四獸山」包含哪四座山，讓身為在地居民的她感到相當錯愕與失望。此外，談及近期發生的兒虐事件時，她也哽咽表示市民期望看到領導者能真正站出來承擔家長心聲，成為社會的安全後盾。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 5 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>170<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A5C10CAFF8BA3664671F0717B0AFE6EE2074E64805C4CDFA2E3FE53A4ED127A7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F0c2e8becfab592dd37ad5120b36d6ddf.jpg"/><img alt="洋流車掃驚見「沈伯洋兒子突現身」！自爆「父子內幕」網被暖哭" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/C186F99B5BD0ED83B5954CC9FD2AAF3A646C54E263BAB890955B086BCD46A808/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F0c2e8becfab592dd37ad5120b36d6ddf.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;dbdfa07b-391c-3a69-b14c-c2bf5b2aadc5&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:13,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;洋流車掃驚見「沈伯洋兒子突現身」！自爆「父子內幕」網被暖哭&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:13;ct:story;g:dbdfa07b-391c-3a69-b14c-c2bf5b2aadc5;slk:洋流車掃驚見「沈伯洋兒子突現身」！自爆「父子內幕」網被暖哭;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="洋流車掃驚見「沈伯洋兒子突現身」！自爆「父子內幕」網被暖哭" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E8%BB%8A%E6%8E%83%E9%A9%9A%E8%A6%8B-%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E5%85%92%E5%AD%90%E7%AA%81%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB-%E8%87%AA%E7%88%86-%E7%88%B6%E5%AD%90%E5%85%A7%E5%B9%95-%E7%B6%B2%E8%A2%AB%E6%9A%96%E5%93%AD-082449869.html">洋流車掃驚見「沈伯洋兒子突現身」！自爆「父子內幕」網被暖哭</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">政治中心／綜合報導隨著2026九合一大選決戰日逼近，民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋「台北大洋流號」今（18日）第二站前進松山、信義選區，車隊還沒正式出發，年僅26歲的民進黨市議員參選人郭凡就提前現身，與當地民眾互動，沒想到郭凡接受現場訪問時，竟意外揭露自己與44歲沈伯洋的特殊淵源，原來兩人不只是同樣在松山、信義長大，還都是「復興寶寶」，沈伯洋更是他的大學長，談到日前沈伯洋替他站台時，被外界笑稱根本是「沈爸爸」上身，郭凡當場害羞笑出來「1句話認了」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 23 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>14<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/17660D1A4B0DCAEEBF4C19AD680384041573567445DC4AABC16336F44AA01D72/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Ffa62ef3722505d4549a8fd69d2b9931b.jpg"/><img alt="韓國瑜喊蓋萬里長城「高雄台南不來往」！高雄人怒嗆：說什麼鬼" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7F5EB0D982FA45C2D399FA4F67FEE21BA08AF6070223709EB62BEBEDA3BB55BD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Ffa62ef3722505d4549a8fd69d2b9931b.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;cadd4be2-ca04-3e95-a85b-2562e8f17213&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:15,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;韓國瑜喊蓋萬里長城「高雄台南不來往」！高雄人怒嗆：說什麼鬼&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:15;ct:story;g:cadd4be2-ca04-3e95-a85b-2562e8f17213;slk:韓國瑜喊蓋萬里長城「高雄台南不來往」！高雄人怒嗆：說什麼鬼;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="韓國瑜喊蓋萬里長城「高雄台南不來往」！高雄人怒嗆：說什麼鬼" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%9F%93%E5%9C%8B%E7%91%9C%E5%96%8A%E8%93%8B%E8%90%AC%E9%87%8C%E9%95%B7%E5%9F%8E-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%86%E5%BE%80-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%80%92%E5%97%86-%E8%AA%AA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E9%AC%BC-011745811.html">韓國瑜喊蓋萬里長城「高雄台南不來往」！高雄人怒嗆：說什麼鬼</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">政治中心／楊佩怡報導高雄市長選戰進入白熱化階段，17日晚間藍綠兩營各自舉行大型造勢活動，隔空較勁意味濃厚。民進黨高雄市長參選人賴瑞隆成立競選總部，邀請黨內高層重磅力挺；國民黨參選人柯志恩則舉辦廟口開講，力邀立法院長韓國瑜重返港都站台。然而，韓國瑜在致詞時拋出「台南與高雄之間蓋萬里長城」的言論，迅速引發高雄網友怒轟：「到底誰讓他當立法院長的」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 1 天前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>136<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] h-auto lg:h-auto"><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;692a79ae-cf15-3865-9211-e7afb833664e&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:16,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:16;ct:story;g:692a79ae-cf15-3865-9211-e7afb833664e;slk:「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E6%9B%87%E8%8A%B1-%E7%8F%BE-%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%B8%AB%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80%E7%B5%90%E5%B1%80-%E5%BE%85%E6%BD%AE%E6%B0%B4%E8%A4%AA%E5%8E%BB%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%8C-131008526.html">「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋掀起「洋流」，他日前接受媒體專訪，當場拿出隨身攜帶的塔羅牌，親自替選戰最後40多天的發展占卜。針對「洋流」，命理專家、吠陀占星權威李靜唯表示，熱鬧的浪花或許能博得一時的關注，但潮水褪去之後，唯有禁得起泥土檢驗的踏實治理與寬容厚度，才能真正承載一座城市的未來。。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中時新聞網 ・ 19 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>25<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/365554FE4971F1C6FD5D71A2862BE12ED0BB59772133886F580E88282F849302/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F820f6372fc66a6f5ab034ff79586a3ec.jpg"/><img alt="徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/EC560C92651E17F24190A3E6DE31F234775BE2BA681A3100B7DB9C28637DF8D9/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F820f6372fc66a6f5ab034ff79586a3ec.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;3c3fb3f6-fbcd-3edb-9a26-b24d4cfebe33&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:17,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:17;ct:story;g:3c3fb3f6-fbcd-3edb-9a26-b24d4cfebe33;slk:徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BE%90%E5%B7%A7%E8%8A%AF-%E7%8C%9B%E9%96%8B%E6%88%B0%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E9%81%AD%E5%8F%8D%E6%AE%BA-%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%9F%E5%A5%B3%E6%AD%8C%E6%89%8B%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8B%E5%8E%BB%E7%94%A91%E5%8F%A5%E5%A4%A7%E7%97%9B%E6%93%8A-020328563.html">徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">政治中心／綜合報導2026台北市長選戰持續升溫，國民黨立委徐巧芯18日受訪時，將矛頭指向民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋，批評他擔任立委期間沒有為台北市爭取建設，甚至直指沈伯洋「沒有政績、只有人設」，沒想到，相關言論曝光後，歌手謝和弦的妻子陳緗妮也在臉書發文，翻出沈伯洋過去擔任不分區立委的責任區其實是花蓮縣，發文反問：「徐巧芯為什麼要問沈伯洋為台北市做了什麼？蛤？？？？」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 6 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>159<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/DA48B2E9A392AFF21D63317DD76B840986881A8B9889B40DDDDC66FDD8657028/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Febc.net.tw%2F3d525e022d7cd5fd2f6ef01c5322de57.jpg"/><img alt="桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F043BB5276C5490200B52803ED384FF83C38A42F72AA058F3979D7470E2522F6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Febc.net.tw%2F3d525e022d7cd5fd2f6ef01c5322de57.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;f70948d1-1a31-339b-9aa5-8386856c5fff&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:19,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:19;ct:story;g:f70948d1-1a31-339b-9aa5-8386856c5fff;slk:桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E9%81%AD8%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%96%E8%A1%8C%E6%9A%B4%E6%89%93%E8%B8%B9%E4%B8%8B%E9%AB%94-%E6%B6%89%E6%A1%88%E5%AD%B8%E7%94%9F%E4%BB%8A%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD-074700463.html">桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">EBC東森新聞 ・ 34 分鐘前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>發表留言</span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] h-auto lg:h-auto"><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;13eb27b1-8897-350d-b5a0-0bec802df457&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:20,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;蔣萬安穩操勝券？旅美教授用哈佛模型推估 驚曝藍綠6都最新勝率&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:20;ct:story;g:13eb27b1-8897-350d-b5a0-0bec802df457;slk:蔣萬安穩操勝券？旅美教授用哈佛模型推估 驚曝藍綠6都最新勝率;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="蔣萬安穩操勝券？旅美教授用哈佛模型推估 驚曝藍綠6都最新勝率" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E7%A9%A9%E6%93%8D%E5%8B%9D%E5%88%B8-%E6%97%85%E7%BE%8E%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E7%94%A8%E5%93%88%E4%BD%9B%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%8E%A8%E4%BC%B0-%E9%A9%9A%E6%9B%9D%E8%97%8D%E7%B6%A06%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8B%9D%E7%8E%87-234023775.html">蔣萬安穩操勝券？旅美教授用哈佛模型推估 驚曝藍綠6都最新勝率</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">2026九合一選舉將於11月28日登場，六都市長選戰進入最後倒數，究竟藍綠版圖會不會重新洗牌？旅美教授翁履中18日在臉書分享最新選情分析，參考哈佛大學教授Gary King研究團隊的選舉預測方法，結合2010年以來六都選舉資料及今年47份公開民調進行推估。結果顯示，六都最可能維持「藍4綠2」格局，國民黨在台北、桃園及台中領先，民進黨則在台南、高雄占優，新北市成為最大變數。至於外界關注的「洋流」能否撼動台北市長蔣萬安，翁履中推估，納入現任優勢等因素後，民進黨候選人沈伯洋的勝率約落在1至2成，但仍有翻盤可能。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中時新聞網 ・ 8 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>11<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3CB8EF38AD4635EC7A420BB55ADB6B9175AA5B4DBCC835B3948CE192610DE701/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F481076a8e53746efe04109258d996c3e.jpg"/><img alt="認了「蔣萬安有可能落選」沈富雄：很像要日落西山了、夕陽了 你知道嗎？" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/61E727CDD247C229D0ABFC4B957637D7F5B7D07B983023340BFDA7767F3E1EC7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F481076a8e53746efe04109258d996c3e.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;3020e32c-1359-3060-ad06-eab058e15fd3&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:21,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;認了「蔣萬安有可能落選」沈富雄：很像要日落西山了、夕陽了 你知道嗎？&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:21;ct:story;g:3020e32c-1359-3060-ad06-eab058e15fd3;slk:認了「蔣萬安有可能落選」沈富雄：很像要日落西山了、夕陽了 你知道嗎？;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="認了「蔣萬安有可能落選」沈富雄：很像要日落西山了、夕陽了 你知道嗎？" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%AA%8D%E4%BA%86-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%90%BD%E9%81%B8-%E6%B2%88%E5%AF%8C%E9%9B%84-%E5%BE%88%E5%83%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%97%A5%E8%90%BD%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%86-%E5%A4%95%E9%99%BD%E4%BA%86-011304091.html">認了「蔣萬安有可能落選」沈富雄：很像要日落西山了、夕陽了 你知道嗎？</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">[Newtalk新聞] 九合一地方選舉將於下月舉行，民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋掀起「洋流」聲勢驚人，積極破圈也讓國民黨不少人開始緊張。前立委沈富雄前幾天才和「戰鬥藍」發起人趙少康在節目上因專訪沈伯洋發生爭論，18日又在同場來賓國民黨台北市議員李柏毅和國民黨立委葉元之面前脫口直言，看到目前「洋流」的態勢，現任市長蔣萬安「有可能落選」，引發熱烈討論。 沈富雄先前在《少康戰情室》節目中至少兩度批評「綜藝教父」王偉忠和趙少康專訪沈伯洋是在幫助對手破圈，直指沈伯洋擺明是有目的性的想找藍營節目、不是什麼「善類」。趙少康當場反駁，身為媒體人，藍綠白的人選都應該可以邀請，善盡訪問責任，不應把選情不振歸咎於媒體。當沈富雄還想繼續爭辯，趙少康還不耐煩打斷，讓節目進廣告。 沈富雄18日上《TVBS戰情室》坦言：「現在我必須講，辯論還沒開始，大家就已經看好沈伯洋，這個危機非常的深啊！原來我是以為沈伯洋只有在媒體、電視、廣播佔上風，這個就差不多了，現在不是耶！這段我是要講給柏毅還有元之聽的，我跟你講，蔣萬安有可能落選！有可能落選！」 沈富雄接著又以同樣論述指稱，洋流是「狼披羊衣」，國民黨的主持人不要再邀沈伯洋接</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">Newtalk新聞 ・ 6 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>104<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/54595DECEEFC52594C7BC49EBA48194BF2A8CB41F20CF0745D2D22097A459FA8/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F810cad543c39b0b25b22fba0bd3e7d7f.jpg"/><img alt="才槓趙少康做球給沈伯洋！沈富雄驚吐「蔣萬安可能落選」：日落西山了" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/142622A11F0745D79C150B165BF1FFFB3F663FC0FBC4DD51F0D80958DA0BF1A6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F810cad543c39b0b25b22fba0bd3e7d7f.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;749a41b0-8dbb-35cf-95d1-297edfec32d6&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:23,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;才槓趙少康做球給沈伯洋！沈富雄驚吐「蔣萬安可能落選」：日落西山了&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:23;ct:story;g:749a41b0-8dbb-35cf-95d1-297edfec32d6;slk:才槓趙少康做球給沈伯洋！沈富雄驚吐「蔣萬安可能落選」：日落西山了;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="才槓趙少康做球給沈伯洋！沈富雄驚吐「蔣萬安可能落選」：日落西山了" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%8D%E6%A7%93%E8%B6%99%E5%B0%91%E5%BA%B7%E5%81%9A%E7%90%83%E7%B5%A6%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E6%B2%88%E5%AF%8C%E9%9B%84%E9%A9%9A%E5%90%90-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%90%BD%E9%81%B8-%E6%97%A5%E8%90%BD%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%86-211200342.html">才槓趙少康做球給沈伯洋！沈富雄驚吐「蔣萬安可能落選」：日落西山了</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">選戰倒數，民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋車掃展現高人氣，引發政壇高度關注。前立委沈富雄日前示警直言現任市長蔣萬安「有可能落選」，形容其選情如同日落西山，並呼籲藍營主持人切勿再邀訪幫對手造勢。對於盧秀燕將出任蔣萬安競選總部主委，沈富雄認為這是危機中的急救。此言論引發網友熱議，外界解讀沈富雄此舉意在催化藍營危機感，藉此激發基本盤投票率，為選情增添變數。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 11 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>63<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/990EBA1A56113BEDF715ADA8210BFFAA7410B56B92134841FBEA904A10445A08/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ffountmedia_io_269%2Fcec6d4909d412e88779a45540b1c4210"/><img alt="遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E178B6A220C338C1B4B1A958BA6D204FEDA66A5136103DE644815545112E2BD7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ffountmedia_io_269%2Fcec6d4909d412e88779a45540b1c4210"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;99d3e6a9-804c-3693-8619-a85e8636fb3f&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:24,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:24;ct:story;g:99d3e6a9-804c-3693-8619-a85e8636fb3f;slk:遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%81%AD%E5%BE%90%E5%B7%A7%E8%8A%AF%E5%97%86-%E6%88%91%E5%80%91%E6%9C%83%E8%B4%8F-%E7%9A%84%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%AD%B8%E5%BC%9F%E6%A5%8A%E7%9B%9B%E5%AE%89%E7%99%BC%E9%95%B7%E6%96%87%E8%AB%87%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%90%8C%E5%9C%A8%E6%B0%B8%E5%90%89%E8%B7%AF%E9%95%B7%E5%A4%A7-%E4%BB%96%E5%BE%9E%E4%BE%86%E6%B2%92%E6%9C%89%E9%9B%A2%E9%96%8B%E9%81%8E%E4%BA%94%E5%88%86%E5%9F%94-222920751.html">遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">「他從來沒有離開過五分埔。」10月18日上午，帶著兩個兒子的楊盛安，當面向台北市長蔣萬安表明自己是學弟，但這次支持沈伯洋，一旁的國民黨立委徐巧芯隨即接話「我們還是會贏」。楊盛安隨後在臉書發表長文，分享支持沈伯洋的原因：兩人同在永吉路一帶長大，看到沈伯洋走訪社區，細數水果攤、麵線與油飯店，熟悉的街坊記憶讓他感受到，即使沈伯洋赴美求學、搬家、當上立委，始終沒有離開成長的地方。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">放言 Fount Media ・ 9 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>34<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F9F9ED6DEB889EEC4FF5372A753FACDD16AEFE37A805E4931C7053C068B80C75/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2Fcf4efce6cebcccb985747a56a772f1ed.jpg"/><img alt="蘇姿丰父親助陣沈伯洋喊「台北不需要權貴」 蔣萬安這樣回" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/AFA4D97F172E19A5350E2C723AD288C1C35E6C89315AFCA6FD1FF6F41C352248/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2Fcf4efce6cebcccb985747a56a772f1ed.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;1f9205b1-78e6-3ce3-b1c2-329c6ad46751&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:25,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;蘇姿丰父親助陣沈伯洋喊「台北不需要權貴」 蔣萬安這樣回&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:25;ct:story;g:1f9205b1-78e6-3ce3-b1c2-329c6ad46751;slk:蘇姿丰父親助陣沈伯洋喊「台北不需要權貴」 蔣萬安這樣回;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="蘇姿丰父親助陣沈伯洋喊「台北不需要權貴」 蔣萬安這樣回" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%98%87%E5%A7%BF%E4%B8%B0%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E5%8A%A9%E9%99%A3%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E5%96%8A-%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%AC%8A%E8%B2%B4-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E9%80%99%E6%A8%A3%E5%9B%9E-030844105.html">蘇姿丰父親助陣沈伯洋喊「台北不需要權貴」 蔣萬安這樣回</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋昨（18日）晚在民生社區民權公園舉行市政開講，超微半導體（AMD）董事長蘇姿丰的父親蘇春槐回台助陣，他看好沈伯洋有能力帶領台北成為亞洲最偉大的城市，還說「台北市長並不需要權貴」暗指台北市長蔣萬安；蔣萬安今（19）日表示，「屬於我的標籤，我要怎麼撕，撕不掉，但不屬於我的標籤，</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">自由時報 ・ 5 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>14<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6A79051EC4199F55495E3E372035824EAE1297EE033B44167A626D2646DFBA62/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F71bac70e1e42e3d19d03f7f6f5d85475.png"/><img alt="超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3E28C1082F0AE061A8F90D0CE875FF4453C137E43237E2D440FA62B6918C5336/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F71bac70e1e42e3d19d03f7f6f5d85475.png"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;1184c3fa-beca-39a1-959a-7699a6f1fa5b&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:27,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:27;ct:story;g:1184c3fa-beca-39a1-959a-7699a6f1fa5b;slk:超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B6%85%E9%81%8E3%E8%90%AC%E4%BA%BA%E6%93%A0%E7%88%86%E9%80%A0%E5%8B%A2%E6%9C%83%E5%A0%B4-%E5%BC%B5%E5%96%84%E6%94%BF%E5%BF%8D%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E9%96%8B%E8%BD%9F-%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E6%9C%89%E6%94%BF%E8%A6%8B%E5%97%8E-%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E6%90%97%E4%BA%82-135933091.html">超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">桃園市長張善政今（17）日晚間舉辦大型造勢活動，藍白大咖齊聚相挺，現場更湧入3萬人。張善政表示，選舉時總會遭到抹黑，自己最近也被唱衰到差一點懷疑人生，「哪有唱衰自己城市市政建設的？桃園不是國民黨的、不是民進黨的，是大家的桃園！」</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中天新聞網 ・ 1 天前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>84<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 lg:mb-3" id="stream-loadmore-placeholder"></div></div></div></section></div></main><div class="mt-module-gap lg:w-article-aside w-full shrink-0 lg:mt-0"><div class=""><aside><div class="mx-auto text-center hidden lg:block mb-module-gap min-w-[300px] min-h-[600px]" id="sda-top-right-iframe">
