efa8\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-10-17T10:20:37Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%AD%B7%E5%9C%8B%E9%99%A2%E9%95%B7%E9%A9%9A%E5%96%9C%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB-%E8%98%87%E5%B7%A7%E6%85%A7-%E7%BE%85%E6%96%87%E5%B4%87%E8%81%AF%E5%90%88%E7%AB%B6%E7%B8%BD%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B-%E5%AE%A3%E7%A4%BA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B8%E5%92%8C%E6%B1%BA%E5%BF%83-070024959.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":7,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%AD%B7%E5%9C%8B%E9%99%A2%E9%95%B7%E9%A9%9A%E5%96%9C%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB-%E8%98%87%E5%B7%A7%E6%85%A7-%E7%BE%85%E6%96%87%E5%B4%87%E8%81%AF%E5%90%88%E7%AB%B6%E7%B8%BD%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B-%E5%AE%A3%E7%A4%BA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B8%E5%92%8C%E6%B1%BA%E5%BF%83-070024959.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-10-17T10:20:37Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9A17AF4AFFE89CF15FA9D0C362A5061EF16886A875A1EB23E596FD9C70795A34/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F4480bbab04e6a99bcbb5276f2d44c803.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6ACD3A009C543487D82515B62A093B0BB46559E0D3436EDE44E33A708865279A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F4480bbab04e6a99bcbb5276f2d44c803.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftvn.com.tw/4480bbab04e6a99bcbb5276f2d44c803.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"即時中心／顏一軒報導民進黨新北市長參選人蘇巧慧今（17）日參加新北第七選區（永和）議員參選人羅文崇聯合競總成立大會。羅文崇指出，身為深耕基層的民代，他與蘇巧慧的強強聯手，正意味著地方建設需求與市長級政策規劃的無縫接軌，期盼未來若有機會能順利當選，能繼續守護永和。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"護國院長驚喜現身！蘇巧慧、羅文崇聯合競總成立　宣示守護永和決心\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"護國院長驚喜現身！蘇巧慧、羅文崇聯合競總成立　宣示守護永和決心\",\"uuid\":\"394644a0-fe20-38ff-9030-ac1500878617\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-10-19T06:00:01Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%8A%B1%E8%93%AE%E9%80%A3%E9%87%91%E7%B4%99%E9%83%BD%E9%80%99%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%89%E7%85%A7-%E7%AB%A5%E5%AD%90%E8%B3%A2%E5%96%8A%E8%A2%82%E8%A6%8B%E7%AC%91-%E9%80%99%E6%98%AF%E8%94%A3%E4%BB%8B%E7%9F%B3%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3-%E5%BC%B5%E5%B3%BB%E7%AB%B6%E7%B8%BD-%E5%8F%8D%E5%82%85%E5%B4%90%E8%90%81-060001287.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":8,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%8A%B1%E8%93%AE%E9%80%A3%E9%87%91%E7%B4%99%E9%83%BD%E9%80%99%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%8E%89%E7%85%A7-%E7%AB%A5%E5%AD%90%E8%B3%A2%E5%96%8A%E8%A2%82%E8%A6%8B%E7%AC%91-%E9%80%99%E6%98%AF%E8%94%A3%E4%BB%8B%E7%9F%B3%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3-%E5%BC%B5%E5%B3%BB%E7%AB%B6%E7%B8%BD-%E5%8F%8D%E5%82%85%E5%B4%90%E8%90%81-060001287.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"今周刊\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-10-19T06:00:01Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/67211928C0F4F2002C86B8C2D48FA941325C383383BA4033BB8831B0BE135D93/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fbusinesstoday.com.tw%2Fc467be759b9b89156ae29c28f9274d6f.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/135E52C0B41C43EB0EE397588E486A31A4EE75F3147DE460F3F4C2160E27C414/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fbusinesstoday.com.tw%2Fc467be759b9b89156ae29c28f9274d6f.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/businesstoday.com.tw/c467be759b9b89156ae29c28f9274d6f.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"無黨籍花蓮縣長參選人、議長張峻週六（10/17）成立競選總部，現場湧入大量支持群眾，和碩董事長童子賢、行政院政委季連成、有國民黨背景的前議長賴進坤、民進黨縣議員張美慧和多位政商界人士都現身站台，堪稱是「花蓮反傅崐萁勢力大集結」。 童子賢致詞時重砲批評傅崐萁家族長期輪流執政，痛批花蓮政治如同一攤死水。季連成則自爆去年光復洪災期間，曾遭張峻勸進參選縣長，雖然最後婉拒，但仍承諾全力支持在地出身的張峻，並協助規劃完整防災白皮書。 張峻壓軸上台表示，這場選舉從找場地、租遊覽車都遭到很多困難和阻礙，但是沒有讓他們退縮，感謝這麼多跨黨派朋友願意站出來。這些年花蓮經歷地震、颱風、洪災，觀光受到衝擊，政府卻沒有恢復經濟、振興觀光，他決定要站出來。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"「花蓮連金紙都這人的玉照」童子賢喊袂見笑：這是蔣介石時代？張峻競總「反傅崐萁」跨黨派集結\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"「花蓮連金紙都這人的玉照」童子賢喊袂見笑：這是蔣介石時代？張峻競總「反傅崐萁」跨黨派集結\",\"uuid\":\"a49939d9-6e15-3ec1-aae5-7d36ea80e24f\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-10-19T01:13:03Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E4%BB%8A%E5%B0%87%E9%9C%87%E6%92%BC%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83-%E7%9B%A7%E8%94%A3%E9%AB%94%E5%88%B6-%E6%88%90%E5%BD%A2-5%E8%97%8D%E5%A7%94%E5%B0%87%E5%85%A5%E5%88%97-011303855.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":11,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E4%BB%8A%E5%B0%87%E9%9C%87%E6%92%BC%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83-%E7%9B%A7%E8%94%A3%E9%AB%94%E5%88%B6-%E6%88%90%E5%BD%A2-5%E8%97%8D%E5%A7%94%E5%B0%87%E5%85%A5%E5%88%97-011303855.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中天新聞網\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-10-19T01:13:03Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D5414A0E63B8FB44087DC91888A43C1C9934277CAD4DA09F6BF2998ECFB583DB/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F08bb1164b324bc190c5239fc1715cf95.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/AB51374165099553B04FD6CBA9540F68DB1B2F274FC7D958795069278681BF78/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F08bb1164b324bc190c5239fc1715cf95.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/gotv_ctitv_com_tw_678/08bb1164b324bc190c5239fc1715cf95.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"距離縣市九合一選舉還剩40天，尋求連任的國民黨台北市長蔣萬安今（19日）下午2時將舉行記者會，正式宣布競選總部主委為台中市長盧秀燕，總幹事為立委羅智強，執行總幹事由立委徐巧芯擔任。記者會後，蔣萬安還將前往《少康戰情室》接受趙少康專訪。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"蔣萬安今將震撼宣布！「盧蔣體制」成形　5藍委將入列\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"蔣萬安今將震撼宣布！「盧蔣體制」成形　5藍委將入列\",\"uuid\":\"6064ab75-3812-31e3-bb37-6be0f76f1117\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}}],\"sportsCardData\":\"$undefined\",\"stockSymbols\":[]},\"isLineApp\":false,\"navigationList\":[{\"name\":\"焦點\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"AI 事件整理\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/news-story/\",\"badge\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false,\"isFooterItem\":false},{\"name\":\"Yahoo畫重點\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/topic/explains/\"},{\"name\":\"熱門新聞\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/most-popular/\"},{\"name\":\"天氣\",\"url\":\"https://weather.yahoo.com/zh-hant-tw/\",\"badge\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false,\"isFooterItem\":false},{\"name\":\"民調\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/poll/\",\"badge\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false,\"isFooterItem\":false},{\"name\":\"專輯\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/topic/\",\"badge\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false,\"isFooterItem\":false},{\"name\":\"合作媒體\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/provider/\"}]},{\"name\":\"即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/archive/\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"娛樂即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/entertainment/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"國際即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/world/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"政治即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/politics/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"社會即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/society/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"財經即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/finance/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"生活即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/lifestyle/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"運動即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/sports/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"科技即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/technology/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"健康即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/h