s://media.zenfs.com/ko/mirrormedia.mg/2bf5be667f1a1483043d1b52b5796b97.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/BDF6A816577039D64E4BC8C7F6D7FB9A529BACEC2E463B4A892F4608C6B2ADEA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F2bf5be667f1a1483043d1b52b5796b97.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/821F34A34EEFBAB730A0A42F3479F983A886416E6CD1F8DF9234AA2D3394C4AD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F2bf5be667f1a1483043d1b52b5796b97.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"為兒子再給老公一次機會　女星懷二胎4年後還是離婚了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"f8dcc3ff-96ea-3b1d-bd73-ae404ded7e8c\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%87%91%E9%90%98%E5%B0%88%E8%A8%AA-%E8%88%92%E8%8F%AF%E9%9A%BB%E8%BA%AB%E8%B5%B4%E9%9F%93%E9%97%96%E8%95%A9-%E6%9B%BE%E5%AF%B6%E5%84%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E8%A7%80%E8%BD%89%E8%AE%8A-%E8%87%AA%E6%9B%9D%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%AA%E6%B1%82-4%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B-232825757.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":3},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%87%91%E9%90%98%E5%B0%88%E8%A8%AA-%E8%88%92%E8%8F%AF%E9%9A%BB%E8%BA%AB%E8%B5%B4%E9%9F%93%E9%97%96%E8%95%A9-%E6%9B%BE%E5%AF%B6%E5%84%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E8%A7%80%E8%BD%89%E8%AE%8A-%E8%87%AA%E6%9B%9D%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%AA%E6%B1%82-4%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B-232825757.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"f69d759d-180b-388f-b33c-2de9f101d955\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"（金鐘專訪）舒華隻身赴韓闖蕩！曾寶儀人生觀轉變 自曝現在只求「4件事」\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"自由時報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:28:25Z\",\"summary\":\"家，一定要得到父母認同才算數嗎？曾寶儀陪著《我們回家吧》的來賓回望成長、走進生活，也逐漸找到自己的答案。今年《我們回家吧3》入圍第61屆金鐘獎「生活風格節目獎」，她也角逐「生活風格節目主持人獎」。談起節目帶來的體會，她以隻身在韓國闖蕩的舒華為例，提醒每個尋找歸屬的人：「家裡最重要的成員是你自己。」\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/libertytimes_786/9eff0eb69e7fc45a294807003fa28662.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/AA23F1CD80A2ADA60B24B2D4FD0BC82FE8A48B03B90F117D98ABB4AC5758B8D8/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2F9eff0eb69e7fc45a294807003fa28662.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B0CF5A36953728AF5CAEC47587EE855A50115727C8F6AA21364F52AA1D7DA78C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2F9eff0eb69e7fc45a294807003fa28662.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"（金鐘專訪）舒華隻身赴韓闖蕩！曾寶儀人生觀轉變 自曝現在只求「4件事」\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"f69d759d-180b-388f-b33c-2de9f101d955\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%A2%81%E6%9C%9D%E5%81%89-%E5%8A%89%E5%98%89%E7%8E%B2%E5%90%8C%E6%A1%86%E8%91%9B%E8%90%8A%E7%BE%8E%E5%A4%A9%E7%8E%8B-%E7%B6%B2%E7%9C%8B%E5%82%BB-%E4%BB%A5%E7%82%BA%E6%98%AFai-050038445.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":1},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%A2%81%E6%9C%9D%E5%81%89-%E5%8A%89%E5%98%89%E7%8E%B2%E5%90%8C%E6%A1%86%E8%91%9B%E8%90%8A%E7%BE%8E%E5%A4%A9%E7%8E%8B-%E7%B6%B2%E7%9C%8B%E5%82%BB-%E4%BB%A5%E7%82%BA%E6%98%AFai-050038445.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"aa78907a-5e89-3d34-9a0f-f20f83958e75\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"梁朝偉、劉嘉玲同框葛萊美天王！網看傻：以為是AI\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T05:00:38Z\",\"summary\":\"娛樂中心／陳韋如報導加拿大流行天王威肯（The Weeknd）日前飛抵香港，為即將登場的「After Hours Til Dawn」世界巡迴演唱會預熱。令人驚喜的是，影后劉嘉玲當晚無預警在社群曬出與丈夫梁朝偉、威肯的三人合照，威肯不僅在貼文下方留言，還用另一個官方帳號分享與梁朝偉聊天的側拍照，搭配王菲經典歌曲《夢中人》，瞬間在影迷與樂迷圈掀起轟動，網友紛紛來朝聖「兩個世界的巨星頂峰相會」、「嚇爛！以為是AI」。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/ftvn.com.tw/714e18e778c6e7cb976f1d5556624c6f.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/34F00BF20DDCCC5B167C024504DA62F2ED64682C3D64EC9EC1ABF4E65A96BB8F/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F714e18e778c6e7cb976f1d5556624c6f.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/03A64D6ECEF01C26A3FE2242CE3E57504344EEB99475C09C598A8A0BC07B4EFC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F714e18e778c6e7cb976f1d5556624c6f.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"梁朝偉、劉嘉玲同框葛萊美天王！網看傻：以為是AI\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"aa78907a-5e89-3d34-9a0f-f20f83958e75\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89-%E7%94%B7%E6%98%9F-%E8%B5%B4%E6%97%A5%E8%B3%A3%E9%B9%B9%E9%85%A5%E9%9B%9E-%E7%8B%82%E9%96%8B5%E5%88%86%E5%BA%97%E7%99%BB%E4%B8%8Anhk-%E6%95%91%E4%BA%86-031800109.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":115},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89-%E7%94%B7%E6%98%9F-%E8%B5%B4%E6%97%A5%E8%B3%A3%E9%B9%B9%E9%85%A5%E9%9B%9E-%E7%8B%82%E9%96%8B5%E5%88%86%E5%BA%97%E7%99%BB%E4%B8%8Anhk-%E6%95%91%E4%BA%86-031800109.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"80f2c10d-6134-3239-9c2a-ca91dbb7061d\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"台灣之光！男星「赴日賣鹹酥雞」狂開5分店登上NHK：救了一條商店街\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-17T03:18:00Z\",\"summary\":\"以經典戲劇《浴火鳳凰》走紅的男星李承泰，淡出演藝圈28年赴日本名古屋創業賣鹹酥雞。日前他與好友王彩樺聚餐，凍齡近況曝光引發熱議。他不僅成功救活瀕臨倒閉的商店街，更擴展5間分店，將大腸麵線等台味發揚光大，多次登上日本NHK等媒體報導，被王彩樺與粉絲大讚是真正的台灣之光。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/setn.com.tw/d30d9a353826d7de58db7dc0698fc923.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ACDE3D77E7F772CD1E3744178616F5EFAD433A8DDAC85492CA2850A52CE64E23/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fd30d9a353826d7de58db7dc0698fc923.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/35F09C17D89C41563FA34DDCAB81CD01B4907B62E6B9814016117C38CE1DF69A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fd30d9a353826d7de58db7dc0698fc923.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"台灣之光！男星「赴日賣鹹酥雞」狂開5分店登上NHK：救了一條商店街\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"80f2c10d-6134-3239-9c2a-ca91dbb7061d\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%97%E8%85%B3%E6%B0%B4-%E8%91%89%E8%98%8A%E5%84%80%E6%97%85%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A31%E5%B9%B4-%E9%A9%9A%E5%98%86%E9%80%99%E8%A3%A1-%E9%9D%88%E6%B0%A3%E6%BB%BF%E6%BB%BF-031217943.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":9},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%97%E8%85%B3%E6%B0%B4-%E8%91%89%E8%98%8A%E5%84%80%E6%97%85%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A31%E5%B9%B4-%E9%A9%9A%E5%98%86%E9%80%99%E8%A3%A1-%E9%9D%88%E6%B0%A3%E6%BB%BF%E6%BB%BF-031217943.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"585e616a-2720-36bc-90cf-da9a4bfba33f\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"「洗腳水」葉蘊儀旅居台灣1年！驚嘆這裡：靈氣滿滿\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T03:12:17Z\",\"summary\":\"娛樂中心／陳韋如報導昔日以廣東國語「19歲（洗腳水）」紅遍大街小巷的甜美偶像葉蘊儀，近日接受媒體訪問，直言私底下的自己「其實沒那麼可愛」。真實的她個性嚴謹且獨立，熱愛隻身一人前往不同國家深度旅居，在體驗過澳洲、法國與英國當地生活後，近期她更悄悄來台長住近一年，除了發展個人的陶藝事業，她也深深迷上台灣自然風光，徹底愛上壯麗靈秀的合歡山。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftvn.com.tw/77afbc56608c210bbdb3bf44f3c0ab7e.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/05310DCE64B3D53E2AA573E276391E15EC725D28B71466B2D0F0A484F6981B7E/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F77afbc56608c210bbdb3bf44f3c0ab7e.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5553DA809359E1BF909FF5BDC8D2B85CF76CC0C7D8FEBE7F024FDA8002E7862D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F77afbc56608c210bbdb3bf44f3c0ab7e.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"「洗腳水」葉蘊儀旅居台灣1年！驚嘆這裡：靈氣滿滿\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"585e616a-2720-36bc-90cf-da9a4bfba33f\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%97%8D%E5%BF%83%E6%B9%84%E8%AD%B7%E8%88%AA%E8%B3%88%E6%B0%B8%E5%A9%95%E5%9C%8B%E6%9C%83%E7%A9%BF%E6%90%AD-%E6%94%BE%E9%81%8E%E9%98%BF%E5%A7%A8%E5%90%A7-012405631.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":53},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%97%8D%E5%BF%83%E6%B9%84%E8%AD%B7%E8%88%AA%E8%B3%88%E6%B0%B8%E5%A9%95%E5%9C%8B%E6%9C%83%E7%A9%BF%E6%90%AD-%E6%94%BE%E9%81%8E%E9%98%BF%E5%A7%A8%E5%90%A7-012405631.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"44bf9ee0-50f3-3b6c-8217-c89fc9007947\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"藍心湄護航賈永婕國會穿搭　「放過阿姨吧」\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"太報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-17T01:24:05Z\",\"summary\":\"藍心湄昨（10╱16）出席TVBS《女人我最大》2026「女人我最大賞」頒獎典禮，被問到賈永婕日前在國會被民進黨籍召委賴惠員要求開會時應穿著「純樸」一事，她幽默笑說：「我跟她一樣喜歡愛馬仕（Hermès）腰帶，阿姨所見略同，大家就放過阿姨吧！」\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/taisounds_com_380/31c343445c62344912cd58b26ee31c57.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/216EC16D118279EC77F1697B25748EF78AA29AB9964ABED103895C13B79C4CE4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F31c343445c62344912cd58b26ee31c57.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FE0FCEC8A5D03AF559EF0B4CC9858205A138B53439016B539F50E1C056B550BD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F31c343445c62344912cd58b26ee31c57.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"藍心湄護航賈永婕國會穿搭　「放過阿姨吧」\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"44bf9ee0-50f3-3b6c-8217-c89fc9007947\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%B6%E8%B7%8C%E5%80%92%E5%A9%A6%E5%8F%8D%E6%8C%A8%E5%91%8A-11%E8%90%AC%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3-%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E9%81%AD%E7%B6%B2%E7%8B%82%E8%BD%9F-%E7%95%B6%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E9%9D%A2%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%8D-%E5%B0%88%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%94%E6%BA%AB%E6%9A%96-010754455.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":187},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%B6%E8%B7%8C%E5%80%92%E5%A9%A6%E5%8F%8D%E6%8C%A8%E5%91%8A-11%E8%90%AC%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3-%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E9%81%AD%E7%B6%B2%E7%8B%82%E8%BD%9F-%E7%95%B6%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E9%9D%A2%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%8D-%E5%B0%88%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%94%E6%BA%AB%E6%9A%96-010754455.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"cca04477-846c-3ce2-898a-1d83fdc545c7\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"「扶跌倒婦反挨告」11萬和解！法官遭網狂轟　當事人出面平反：專業且溫暖\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"太報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T01:07:54Z\",\"summary\":\"台北市一名劉姓退休教授先前在捷運忠孝復興站見到一名婦人跌倒，上前攙扶未果，後續竟反遭對方提告，還被檢方依過失傷害罪起訴，對劉翁造成沉重打擊。近日台北地院開庭，法官宋恩同以親身經歷，勸說劉翁繼續相信「行善的價值」，雙方以11萬元達成和解，未料卻有不少網友誤會成「法官判賠11萬元」，紛紛抨擊法官。對此，劉翁出面喊話，宋恩同是專業、通情達理的法官，11萬元和解是他自己所接受、並非法官下的判決，希望網友不要再盲目攻擊法官。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/taisounds_com_380/7f7bf84b5993fa9bdb20188d3b94bb93.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CA7A59C4C3C5D2E61940511C1842769DB0AF385E76648005547673F61CD7C05F/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F7f7bf84b5993fa9bdb20188d3b94bb93.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D871EC06221664123C1FBF3932BD4808415E33A2BC1337D4967EE53623308CD3/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F7f7bf84b5993fa9bdb20188d3b94bb93.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"「扶跌倒婦反挨告」11萬和解！法官遭網狂轟　當事人出面平反：專業且溫暖\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"cca04477-846c-3ce2-898a-1d83fdc545c7\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%B9%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E8%AC%9B%E8%A9%B1%E8%81%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%87%82-%E9%80%A3%E5%8B%9D%E6%96%87%E9%85%B8-%E6%97%81%E9%82%8A%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%91%BC%E9%BA%BB-%E5%90%8D%E9%86%AB%E4%B8%8D%E5%BF%8D%E5%97%86%E7%88%86-214600056.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":98},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%B9%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E8%AC%9B%E8%A9%B1%E8%81%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%87%82-%E9%80%A3%E5%8B%9D%E6%96%87%E9%85%B8-%E6%97%81%E9%82%8A%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%91%BC%E9%BA%BB-%E5%90%8D%E9%86%AB%E4%B8%8D%E5%BF%8D%E5%97%86%E7%88%86-214600056.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"7b367b20-6869-369e-9232-0e02f1e26580\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"批沈伯洋講話聽不懂！連勝文酸「旁邊可能有人在呼麻」　名醫不忍嗆爆\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T21:46:00Z\",\"summary\":\"民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋參選掀起選戰熱潮，藍營翻出其2014年探討國際「毒品減害政策」的文章抹黑。連勝文站台時痛批沈伯洋說話聽不懂，質疑旁邊有人抽大麻。此言論引發醫師杜承哲與前立委鄭運鵬等人強力反擊，諷刺連勝文的理解能力，網友也紛紛留言聲援沈伯洋，掀起高度關注與熱烈討論。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/setn.com.tw/bcf2857ce6d7354b5862ace8c9607a4c.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/69E4154E7A6BF2C4C00FDB89B9FD8C9D06E25305087CB9B083B0BA46BDB8B968/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fbcf2857ce6d7354b5862ace8c9607a4c.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7DBD0FF5E4D6AF5158D1A727D93603F18769716CAD167CD469C832985CA4AAF4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fbcf2857ce6d7354b5862ace8c9607a4c.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"批沈伯洋講話聽不懂！連勝文酸「旁邊可能有人在呼麻」　名醫不忍嗆爆\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"7b367b20-6869-369e-9232-0e02f1e26580\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%9A%E5%A6%83-%E5%9B%9E%E5%AE%AE-%E5%A5%9A%E5%A4%A2%E7%91%A4%E7%9D%BD%E9%81%958%E5%B9%B4%E5%86%8D%E7%99%BB%E7%B6%AD%E5%AF%86-16%E5%84%84%E5%A4%A2%E5%B9%BB%E8%83%B8%E7%BD%A9%E4%BA%AE%E7%9B%B8-%E7%94%B1%E5%8D%A1%E6%88%B4%E7%8F%8A%E5%AE%B6%E6%97%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B9-015500582.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":5},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%9A%E5%A6%83-%E5%9B%9E%E5%AE%AE-%E5%A5%9A%E5%A4%A2%E7%91%A4%E7%9D%BD%E9%81%958%E5%B9%B4%E5%86%8D%E7%99%BB%E7%B6%AD%E5%AF%86-16%E5%84%84%E5%A4%A2%E5%B9%BB%E8%83%B8%E7%BD%A9%E4%BA%AE%E7%9B%B8-%E7%94%B1%E5%8D%A1%E6%88%B4%E7%8F%8A%E5%AE%B6%E6%97%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B9-015500582.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"f63c200e-da45-3585-b455-39ee2b6b431e\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"「奚妃」回宮！奚夢瑤睽違8年再登維密　16億夢幻胸罩亮相「由卡戴珊家族的她」佩戴\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"鏡週刊Mirror Media\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T01:55:00Z\",\"summary\":\"時尚盛宴維多利亞的秘密時尚秀（Victoria's Secret Fashion Show）在台灣時間今（19）日7時正式登場，今年的亮點滿滿，除了許多舊有天使回歸，還有澳門賭王何鴻燊四房之子何猷君的妻子奚夢瑤睽違8年上秀，背上超大翅膀，氣場全開，另外，備受矚目的Fantasy Bra（夢幻胸罩）也終於亮相，價值約5,000萬美元（約台幣16億），由首次上秀、卡戴珊家族的名媛凱莉（Kylie Jenner）佩戴。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ca/mirrormedia.mg/56f6f1b94bf793b9c8cceab977e65522.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/634AFA5CA0DF9A582A06D4D1E76C65A4A16D22E656C369B6756E156B73B5BD90/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F56f6f1b94bf793b9c8cceab977e65522.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2BD0980285CB73140C48785B89FEB4E77BFF280058D0CF549804B352CE7D8B36/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F56f6f1b94bf793b9c8cceab977e65522.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"「奚妃」回宮！奚夢瑤睽違8年再登維密　16億夢幻胸罩亮相「由卡戴珊家族的她」佩戴\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"f63c200e-da45-3585-b455-39ee2b6b431e\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%AA%E7%94%A8%E6%B0%B4%E6%B2%96-%E6%B2%96-%E6%B0%B4%E5%A3%BA%E7%B4%B0%E8%8F%8C-%E6%AF%94%E9%A6%AC%E6%A1%B6%E5%9D%90%E5%A2%8A%E5%A4%9A4%E8%90%AC%E5%80%8D-%E9%86%AB%E6%9B%9D%E6%AD%A3%E7%A2%BA%E6%B4%97%E6%B3%95-075200794.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":46},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%AA%E7%94%A8%E6%B0%B4%E6%B2%96-%E6%B2%96-%E6%B0%B4%E5%A3%BA%E7%B4%B0%E8%8F%8C-%E6%AF%94%E9%A6%AC%E6%A1%B6%E5%9D%90%E5%A2%8A%E5%A4%9A4%E8%90%AC%E5%80%8D-%E9%86%AB%E6%9B%9D%E6%AD%A3%E7%A2%BA%E6%B4%97%E6%B3%95-075200794.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"563e6a21-92c6-3270-bdb1-1b0edbe3f0b2\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"只用水沖一沖？水壺細菌「比馬桶坐墊多4萬倍」　醫曝正確洗法\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T07:52:00Z\",\"summary\":\"水壺若只簡單沖洗恐滋生大量細菌！美國醫師指出，天天使用的水壺若未徹底清潔，口腔細菌隨唾液進入水壺內累積，48小時內便可能形成生物膜。研究顯示，重複使用水壺的細菌量甚至可能是馬桶座的4萬倍。專家建議，水壺應至少每兩天使用熱水與洗碗精徹底刷洗一次，並搭配刷具破壞生物膜，洗後務必充分晾乾，才能有效降低微生物滋生，保障日常飲水安全。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/c6b7f43d2c49fe91365d5d9ccb3da587.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9F77FD68B38B61EEFA7EFCFA9478D40E200113B49FAE5F33AC1A472AF7D04F54/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fc6b7f43d2c49fe91365d5d9ccb3da587.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/277F7E98F3A3B4D46C7B0710AEA452D57AD6B6B3ACC84772E38CDE03671F00F6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fc6b7f43d2c49fe91365d5d9ccb3da587.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"只用水沖一沖？水壺細菌「比馬桶坐墊多4萬倍」　醫曝正確洗法\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"563e6a21-92c6-3270-bdb1-1b0edbe3f0b2\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E7%9B%A4%E5%89%8D-%E5%A4%96%E8%B3%87%E6%84%9B%E4%BA%86-%E5%8A%A0%E7%A2%BC%E8%B2%B7%E9%80%B2-%E9%80%99%E6%AA%94-4-213500834.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":6},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E7%9B%A4%E5%89%8D-%E5%A4%96%E8%B3%87%E6%84%9B%E4%BA%86-%E5%8A%A0%E7%A2%BC%E8%B2%B7%E9%80%B2-%E9%80%99%E6%AA%94-4-213500834.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"3911bc58-5507-335a-a802-54c9e48fc62a\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"【盤前】外資愛了　加碼買進「這檔」4.3萬張！131萬股東集體跳震胸舞\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T21:35:00Z\",\"summary\":\"台股16日震盪收紅，加權指數上漲141.39點，收在47,111.26點。三大法人動向備受關注，其中擁有百萬股東的中鋼獲得外資青睞，單日大舉加碼超過4.3萬張，帶動股價收在19.55元。外資與投信在面板、金融及傳產股的操作各有著墨，台積電則遭外資賣超逾2萬張，投資人可持續關注法人最新資金流向。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/setn.com.tw/fc92e28d398031ece8005149d2aa0fc8.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/90B1281BAF286EDF107EED7BDE543E5CF9059B54A78E6506A4521DC4A2CA7BFD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ffc92e28d398031ece8005149d2aa0fc8.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1637E554E81B59650FC3DB8E0190660D0DFDB0E4D7390E15F99C683F893608C6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ffc92e28d398031ece8005149d2aa0fc8.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"【盤前】外資愛了　加碼買進「這檔」4.3萬張！131萬股東集體跳震胸舞\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"3911bc58-5507-335a-a802-54c9e48fc62a\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%B2%B9%E7%82%B8%E7%89%A9-%E9%80%99%E9%A1%9E%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9-%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E8%82%A5%E7%88%86-%E5%A2%9E40-%E8%85%A6%E8%A1%80%E7%AE%A1%E7%96%BE%E7%97%85%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA-020500492.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":1},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%B2%B9%E7%82%B8%E7%89%A9-%E9%80%99%E9%A1%9E%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9-%E5%AE%B3%E4%BA%BA%E8%82%A5%E7%88%86-%E5%A2%9E40-%E8%85%A6%E8%A1%80%E7%AE%A1%E7%96%BE%E7%97%85%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA-020500492.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"b4004e31-32e1-358d-a375-258d1ab01c44\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"不是油炸物！「這類食物」害人肥爆、增40%腦血管疾病風險\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T02:05:00Z\",\"summary\":\"營養師老辜指出，最新研究顯示常吃超加工食品會提高內臟脂肪並增加腦部血管異常風險達40%。超加工食品含大量添加物與工業配方，專家建議民眾應減少洋芋片與含糖飲料等攝取，多吃原型食物以維護健康。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/980880eedaf1e913d222cbd0d2f8ccc6.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6894A94E98E51F47DD90BF978AC329DE96938B1E7327ABAB93702D89E5CB680D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F980880eedaf1e913d222cbd0d2f8ccc6.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/65B3F4EF0BA9A8B8C25F8B9B7B8D8B43E23CFFF5118CD87963EBA5F427DE35FA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F980880eedaf1e913d222cbd0d2f8ccc6.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"不是油炸物！「這類食物」害人肥爆、增40%腦血管疾病風險\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"b4004e31-32e1-358d-a375-258d1ab01c44\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BC%B7%E9%A2%B1%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E4%B8%8D%E7%9B%B4%E6%92%B2%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%BA%86-%E7%B2%89%E5%B0%88%E6%9B%9D%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E9%A0%90%E6%B8%AC-%E6%9C%83%E4%BE%B5%E8%A5%B2%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B-%E6%93%A6%E9%82%8A%E9%81%8E-234400665.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":24},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BC%B7%E9%A2%B1%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E4%B8%8D%E7%9B%B4%E6%92%B2%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%BA%86-%E7%B2%89%E5%B0%88%E6%9B%9D%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E9%A0%90%E6%B8%AC-%E6%9C%83%E4%BE%B5%E8%A5%B2%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B-%E6%93%A6%E9%82%8A%E9%81%8E-234400665.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"48efc0bf-2bfe-35eb-9a24-c78d9a9eb139\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"強颱薔琵不直撲台灣了？粉專曝最新預測：會侵襲但有望「擦邊過」\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:44:00Z\",\"summary\":\"強烈颱風「薔琵」持續進逼，氣象署預估週五至週六影響最劇。天氣粉專指出最新預測顯示颱風有望「擦邊過」，但週三起西半部與沿海地區將出現強風。目前薔琵強度略有減弱但將再增強，未來路徑仍有三種可能，取決於高壓減弱狀況，若靠近將帶來強風大雨，北部與東半部民眾須嚴防持續性強降雨。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/setn.com.tw/4d65150cc01be8a7b31f8244e9ee1092.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/72B106871F53849E289B458C7023433AA10F5C1A8D615EA4341824186326DA57/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F4d65150cc01be8a7b31f8244e9ee1092.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/62BE16F69C2F7994027066DD62C3511A9A4F8566A0D7549720FBB32467B45ADB/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F4d65150cc01be8a7b31f8244e9ee1092.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"強颱薔琵不直撲台灣了？粉專曝最新預測：會侵襲但有望「擦邊過」\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"48efc0bf-2bfe-35eb-9a24-c78d9a9eb139\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%83%AD%E9%9D%9C%E7%B4%94%E8%AA%8D%E4%BA%86%E9%9B%A2%E5%A9%9A3%E5%B9%B4-%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%AB%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%97-%E5%A5%B9%E6%94%BE%E6%A3%84%E8%B4%8D%E9%A4%8A%E8%B2%BB%E7%8D%A8%E9%A4%8A2%E5%AD%A9-091319817.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":23},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%83%AD%E9%9D%9C%E7%B4%94%E8%AA%8D%E4%BA%86%E9%9B%A2%E5%A9%9A3%E5%B9%B4-%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%AB%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%97-%E5%A5%B9%E6%94%BE%E6%A3%84%E8%B4%8D%E9%A4%8A%E8%B2%BB%E7%8D%A8%E9%A4%8A2%E5%AD%A9-091319817.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"8464a444-775e-3f44-9ae2-9883b455df71\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"郭靜純認了離婚3年！前夫事業失敗 她放棄贍養費獨養2孩\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"自由時報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T09:13:19Z\",\"summary\":\"55歲女星郭靜純昨日無預警宣布，已與結婚20年的製作人老公王信貴離婚，消息曝光引發外界關注。她今（18）日透露兩人早在3年前就已簽字離婚，當時她不僅同意不拿贍養費，更決定獨自扶養一雙兒女。儘管一度充滿恐慌與無助，仍靠著孩子的陪伴走過低潮。此外，她也罕見談及前夫近況，透露對方至今仍在努力彌補事業失敗造\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/libertytimes_786/d9351eb3afd14c6a5f074b0caa572ff9.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1D9DF6270F4218301A21ADFCEE6422E9498E4B741D9DD788B7635D9654D6167C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2Fd9351eb3afd14c6a5f074b0caa572ff9.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1C63649BF344DB38145D3944A7EBEC92F10EFFA90FA6942DDDB67782B734F96D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2Fd9351eb3afd14c6a5f074b0caa572ff9.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"郭靜純認了離婚3年！前夫事業失敗 她放棄贍養費獨養2孩\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"8464a444-775e-3f44-9ae2-9883b455df71\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BF%97%E5%B7%A5%E8%8A%B18%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%B8%85%E4%B8%8A%E5%99%B8%E6%B2%B3%E6%B5%81%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE-%E5%9B%9E%E9%A0%AD%E7%9C%8B%E5%B4%A9%E6%BD%B0-%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%85%A8%E7%99%BD%E8%B2%BB%E4%BA%86-231600996.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":37},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BF%97%E5%B7%A5%E8%8A%B18%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%B8%85%E4%B8%8A%E5%99%B8%E6%B2%B3%E6%B5%81%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE-%E5%9B%9E%E9%A0%AD%E7%9C%8B%E5%B4%A9%E6%BD%B0-%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%85%A8%E7%99%BD%E8%B2%BB%E4%BA%86-231600996.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"52359127-e447-35a3-a941-2a55f1656544\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"志工花8個月清上噸河流垃圾　回頭看崩潰：工作全白費了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:16:00Z\",\"summary\":\"印度中央邦環保志工喬杜里花費八個多月，徒手將布滿垃圾的阿傑納爾河清理乾淨，重現清澈河水並獲政府讚賞。未料僅過一個月，河道再度被大量垃圾填滿，讓他的心血付諸流水。喬杜里對此感到極度無奈，但強調不會放棄，並發文尋求更有效的清理方案。事件曝光後引發當地民眾熱議，紛紛呼籲政府加強公民意識教育與罰則，杜絕隨意丟棄垃圾的惡習。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/ecf1aab06aa350c04078a75aef0836da.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F50A4D4E64F324936A985C8D73A65AEBEE38B15340BC3C17CF02B84165ACE137/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fecf1aab06aa350c04078a75aef0836da.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4DC4E5C87173CA84A881849FF615140C5CCAE5211806FF69B2DBC7227AAAF2BC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fecf1aab06aa350c04078a75aef0836da.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"志工花8個月清上噸河流垃圾　回頭看崩潰：工作全白費了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"52359127-e447-35a3-a941-2a55f1656544\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B7%AA%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%98%BF%E5%AC%A4%E6%98%AF%E8%87%A8%E6%BC%94-%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%B6%E6%9B%9D%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%BA%AB%E5%88%86-6%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8A%E8%A1%97%E4%BA%86-232805920.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":358},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B7%AA%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%98%BF%E5%AC%A4%E6%98%AF%E8%87%A8%E6%BC%94-%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%B6%E6%9B%9D%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%BA%AB%E5%88%86-6%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8A%E8%A1%97%E4%BA%86-232805920.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"0fb2dac5-d08b-39ae-8c23-74088a4ec958\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"跪沈伯洋的阿嬤是臨演？作家曝真實身分：6年前就上街了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中時新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:28:05Z\",\"summary\":\"民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋17日前往社子島參加活動，一名阿嬤突然下跪陳情，哭求沈伯洋當選後協助當地居民，未料畫面曝光後，卻遭部分網友質疑是事先安排的「臨時演員」，引發議論。對此，作家「漂浪島嶼」18日發文揭露，這名洪姓阿嬤早在6年前、蔣萬安尚未當選台北市長時，就已跟隨反徵收自救會上街抗爭，並非所謂的臨演。他更感嘆，為了保住家園，「別說下跪陳情，趴在地上都是願意」，但也直言，無論蔣萬安或沈伯洋，都未真正回應居民反對徵收的核心訴求。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/chinatimes.com.tw/951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B77B358A9F73C175FBC7952EEB7A111AF994DDCD4C7052CFD3F26561293033CE/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fchinatimes.com.tw%2F951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A1411F833B0274B2A01E4092BD357989D92B679453561E9E5CB434AF4855A746/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fchinatimes.com.tw%2F951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"跪沈伯洋的阿嬤是臨演？作家曝真實身分：6年前就上街了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"0fb2dac5-d08b-39ae-8c23-74088a4ec958\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%8A%E5%8F%A4%E8%A8%B1%E5%85%89%E6%BC%A2-%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%96-%E6%98%94%E8%8A%B1%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E5%B0%8F%E7%94%9F57%E6%AD%B2%E7%8F%BE%E6%B3%81%E6%9B%9D-052655645.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":7},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%8A%E5%8F%A4%E8%A8%B1%E5%85%89%E6%BC%A2-%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%96-%E6%98%94%E8%8A%B1%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E5%B0%8F%E7%94%9F57%E6%AD%B2%E7%8F%BE%E6%B3%81%E6%9B%9D-052655645.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"87487ea7-aa33-3a75-991c-63a73935e00d\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"「上古許光漢」是他？昔花系列小生57歲現況曝\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T05:26:55Z\",\"summary\":\"娛樂中心／曾婕畇報導台灣男星林煒當年憑藉「花系列」電視劇走紅，以斯文俊秀的外型、挺拔身形及獨特氣質，成為不少觀眾心中的經典男神，曾演出《女人花》、《七夕花》等作品。如今，隨著社群平台掀起懷舊追劇風潮，林煒年輕時的戲劇片段竟意外再度受到關注。日前，一名網友在Threads上發文表示，近期不斷被林煒的相關內容洗版，因此重新觀看他出演的戲劇。不料，貼文曝光卻意外引發大批網友的共鳴。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/ftvn.com.tw/abdd891fad4b5039158cd8e8a0fab300.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/38884BC5293F35D64F7118936F75AB20F7CAFAB0FA9A86B6E0D1ABF0F991896C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fabdd891fad4b5039158cd8e8a0fab300.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F84FE91E2A8A111E21AFB14669B35F1EB5DD2C83B3AD3AA1551857062F0DC32A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fabdd891fad4b5039158cd8e8a0fab300.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"「上古許光漢」是他？昔花系列小生57歲現況曝\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"87487ea7-aa33-3a75-991c-63a73935e00d\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%83%AD%E5%8F%B0%E9%8A%98%E4%BB%8A76%E6%AD%B2%E5%A4%A7%E5%A3%BD-%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A-%E9%80%99%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%95-%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7-%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E7%8E%87%E9%99%8D4%E6%88%90-233500170.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":181},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%83%AD%E5%8F%B0%E9%8A%98%E4%BB%8A76%E6%AD%B2%E5%A4%A7%E5%A3%BD-%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A-%E9%80%99%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%95-%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7-%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E7%8E%87%E9%99%8D4%E6%88%90-233500170.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"64c8efee-8cf5-316c-8e87-6b6779342ed2\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"郭台銘76歲大壽！常做「這運動」保健康　死亡率降4成\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-17T23:35:00Z\",\"summary\":\"今（18）日是鴻海創辦人郭台銘76歲生日，其養生之道備受關注。研究指出，打高爾夫球的球員死亡率較一般人低約40％，預期壽命可能增加5年。此外，郭台銘也熱衷健走與爬山，曾與妻子曾馨瑩實踐「日行萬步」。專家表示，日常規律活動與短暫起身走動，有助於消耗熱量並穩定血糖，是維持健康的重要關鍵。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/a4b0fe863d16faa66ba7d5560af79375.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/41939E485BF4A8D2EA4342AEB0F45F2555FADE3190F6661E26C6CF9AE67857F4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fa4b0fe863d16faa66ba7d5560af79375.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E798469F7F11DF601A8B634D028C1325A941E9ACCACB86CE489AC99D54B2BE85/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fa4b0fe863d16faa66ba7d5560af79375.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"郭台銘76歲大壽！常做「這運動」保健康　死亡率降4成\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"64c8efee-8cf5-316c-8e87-6b6779342ed2\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%87%E7%95%B0%E6%9E%9C%E5%88%A5%E5%86%8D%E6%8B%BF%E5%88%80%E5%89%8A-%E5%B0%88%E6%95%99-1%E6%8B%9B%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%8E%BB%E7%9A%AE-%E7%94%A8%E6%89%8B%E5%B0%B1%E8%83%BD%E8%BC%95%E9%AC%86%E5%89%9D%E4%B8%8B-014000333.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":7},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%87%E7%95%B0%E6%9E%9C%E5%88%A5%E5%86%8D%E6%8B%BF%E5%88%80%E5%89%8A-%E5%B0%88%E6%95%99-1%E6%8B%9B%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%8E%BB%E7%9A%AE-%E7%94%A8%E6%89%8B%E5%B0%B1%E8%83%BD%E8%BC%95%E9%AC%86%E5%89%9D%E4%B8%8B-014000333.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"404919a9-eb83-3c64-a76f-70a13903b405\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"奇異果別再拿刀削！專教「1招快速去皮」  用手就能輕鬆剝下\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"常春月刊\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T01:40:00Z\",\"summary\":\"奇異果一年四季都很容易買到，酸甜多汁，不過每次吃之前都得拿刀削皮，對不少人來說有些麻煩。尤其想把果皮削乾淨，又不想連果肉一起削掉，往往得花上一點時間。日本生活網站實測一個不用拿刀削皮的方法，只要先把奇異果「整顆冷凍」，食用前再用流水稍微解凍，竟然只靠手指就能把果皮順利剝下來。 奇異果別急著拿刀削皮 洗乾淨後「整顆冷凍」 首先將整顆奇異果用清水仔細洗乾淨，再使用廚房紙巾等將表面的水分擦乾。接著把奇異果裝進食品用塑膠袋中，再直接放進冷凍庫，至少冷凍6小時以上。實際取出冷凍後的奇異果時，整顆已經變得相當堅硬，這時還不能馬上用手剝皮，還需要多做一個步驟。 冷凍奇異果拿出來怎麼剝？ 放在流水下沖「約1分鐘」 把冷凍庫裡的奇異果取出後，直接放到流水下沖洗約1分鐘，讓表面稍微解凍。過程中不需要使用太大的力氣，就能繼續用手將果皮剝除，相較於平常拿刀一點點削皮，處理起來相當簡單。 奇異果兩端硬硬的怎麼辦？ 再稍微退冰就能用湯匙去除 奇異果兩端較硬的部位，剛從冷凍庫取出時不一定那麼容易處理。原文作者將奇異果再放置一段時間自然解凍後，就能利用湯匙較輕鬆地將兩端較硬的部分去除。因此，如果只是想快速剝除大部分果\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/evergreen.ttvc.com.tw/1523d0c28efdf36be3f9e3c4ab12a42d.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E1011EB0E794A62B17EFF49D3A0BDD8A89F16F485C94A28E37F62B8052861E36/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fevergreen.ttvc.com.tw%2F1523d0c28efdf36be3f9e3c4ab12a42d.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/08F8173791E23495F23BE1FFF76F66F8BB6DB1EC0ED0902839CAA17638870A0B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fevergreen.ttvc.com.tw%2F1523d0c28efdf36be3f9e3c4ab12a42d.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"奇異果別再拿刀削！專教「1招快速去皮」  用手就能輕鬆剝下\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"404919a9-eb83-3c64-a76f-70a13903b405\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E7%B5%90%E6%A7%8B%E7%B4%AE%E5%AF%A6%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E7%9C%BC%E6%B8%85%E6%99%B0%E5%8F%AF%E8%A6%8B-%E4%BC%B0%E6%9C%80%E5%BF%AB%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%89%E6%B7%B1%E5%A4%9C%E7%99%BC%E5%B8%83%E6%B5%B7%E8%AD%A6-075254247.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":100},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E7%B5%90%E6%A7%8B%E7%B4%AE%E5%AF%A6%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E7%9C%BC%E6%B8%85%E6%99%B0%E5%8F%AF%E8%A6%8B-%E4%BC%B0%E6%9C%80%E5%BF%AB%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%89%E6%B7%B1%E5%A4%9C%E7%99%BC%E5%B8%83%E6%B5%B7%E8%AD%A6-075254247.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"14fc8cf1-7543-43ee-85d6-72f0bc5753a8\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"颱風薔琵結構紮實颱風眼清晰可見 估最快周三深夜發布海警\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"Yahoo即時新聞\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T00:35:01Z\",\"summary\":\"氣象專家吳德榮今天（19日）表示，強颱薔琵續增強、擴大，預計今、明兩天即達顛峰。歐洲模式模擬，薔琵可能登陸或自台灣近海北轉，強風豪雨的威脅絕不可小覷；今明兩天西晴東偶雨，21、22日東北季風影響，氣溫逐日下降。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/1400_3804.png\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/00884A96C9304BB2B7581FEF6F0A6585CA9D7748DFC35A05B1ECE23FA1071CA5/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2F1400_3804.png\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D9F39F2D5412C9AA01954448A98895F4CFD712E20A5FAF37DA670CA7B767732C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2F1400_3804.png\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"颱風薔琵結構紮實颱風眼清晰可見 估最快周三深夜發布海警\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"14fc8cf1-7543-43ee-85d6-72f0bc5753a8\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%85%88%E6%BF%9F%E5%90%8D%E9%86%AB%E5%81%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%A6%BB-%E5%81%B7%E6%83%85%E8%A8%98%E6%86%B6%E5%8D%A1%E5%AD%98416%E9%A0%81%E5%81%B7%E6%83%85%E9%90%B5%E8%AD%89-%E6%85%88%E6%BF%9F%E5%90%8D%E9%86%AB%E4%B8%8D%E5%80%AB%E4%BA%BA%E5%A6%BB%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E5%B8%AB%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89-232859062.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":24},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%85%88%E6%BF%9F%E5%90%8D%E9%86%AB%E5%81%B7%E4%BA%BA%E5%A6%BB-%E5%81%B7%E6%83%85%E8%A8%98%E6%86%B6%E5%8D%A1%E5%AD%98416%E9%A0%81%E5%81%B7%E6%83%85%E9%90%B5%E8%AD%89-%E6%85%88%E6%BF%9F%E5%90%8D%E9%86%AB%E4%B8%8D%E5%80%AB%E4%BA%BA%E5%A6%BB%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E5%B8%AB%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89-232859062.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"006aa01a-3c3b-35bc-b02e-70f398658296\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"慈濟名醫偷人妻／記憶卡存416頁偷情鐵證　慈濟名醫不倫人妻護理師醜聞曝光\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"鏡週刊Mirror Media\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:28:59Z\",\"summary\":\"花蓮慈濟醫院外科部長陳言丞，身兼慈濟大學醫學系副教授，在花蓮醫界頗有名望，但卻因為偷吃已婚護理師，被對方丈夫發現，一狀告上法院。陳言丞外表憨厚老實，人緣非常好，加上他的醫術精湛、談吐風趣，同事都大讚他是花蓮慈濟醫院的標竿，萬萬沒想到私德大有問題。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/mirrormedia.mg/aecd0d6791d9a66604019ed576649a36.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D8FC137F4EAAACCBC202647D62E440D5595C18E070A9107023D931CBDFBB064B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2Faecd0d6791d9a66604019ed576649a36.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/05F2917B39A62714B95E825CFFD86313AC4670C4C2BA72A6BF3DFCD42378C181/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2Faecd0d6791d9a66604019ed576649a36.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"慈濟名醫偷人妻／記憶卡存416頁偷情鐵證　慈濟名醫不倫人妻護理師醜聞曝光\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"006aa01a-3c3b-35bc-b02e-70f398658296\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A3%9B%E9%BE%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%A9-%E6%B1%9F%E5%AE%8F%E6%81%A9%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB%E6%8C%BA%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%8F%B0%E6%B4%BE%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E6%84%9F%E6%80%A7%E7%99%BC%E8%81%B2-224756785.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":47},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A3%9B%E9%BE%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%A9-%E6%B1%9F%E5%AE%8F%E6%81%A9%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB%E6%8C%BA%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%8F%B0%E6%B4%BE%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E6%84%9F%E6%80%A7%E7%99%BC%E8%81%B2-224756785.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"ca440ddd-a1d5-330c-972f-e20f836669d9\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"《飛龍在天》江宏恩現身挺沈伯洋   台派女神感性發聲\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"自由時報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T22:47:56Z\",\"summary\":\"55歲本土劇男星江宏恩以經典電視劇《飛龍在天》走紅，民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋18日出席台北市議員林延鳳競選總部成立大會時，江宏恩透過影片現身相挺，還高唱《飛龍在天》邀沈伯洋接力演唱。對此，「台派女神」網紅徐閉感性在臉書發文推崇江宏恩，她說：「江宏恩在Threads本來就沒在藏了，但還是很感謝他願意\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/libertytimes_786/35f89d00d802bffe9cd4590271e7f947.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/74572A2FD8CE4FBDC93AA23793529F74AB9CEB8CBC27D03EB18F4D3E51439319/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2F35f89d00d802bffe9cd4590271e7f947.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/97634C7020718E707AEDE4F6510C1A95040C8F6EE9A66336C73B788F38B21207/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2F35f89d00d802bffe9cd4590271e7f947.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"《飛龍在天》江宏恩現身挺沈伯洋   台派女神感性發聲\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"ca440ddd-a1d5-330c-972f-e20f836669d9\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E8%82%A1%E9%87%8D%E6%8C%AB%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%83%E6%83%B6%E6%83%B6-%E5%BC%B5%E8%8F%B2-%E9%9D%A01%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C-%E8%B1%AA%E8%B3%BA5%E5%84%84%E8%80%81%E7%A5%9E%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%A8-%E7%AC%91%E7%A8%B1-033700458.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":73},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E8%82%A1%E9%87%8D%E6%8C%AB%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%83%E6%83%B6%E6%83%B6-%E5%BC%B5%E8%8F%B2-%E9%9D%A01%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C-%E8%B1%AA%E8%B3%BA5%E5%84%84%E8%80%81%E7%A5%9E%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%A8-%E7%AC%91%E7%A8%B1-033700458.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"570f577b-dc69-369e-9fa1-501d1d402a32\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"台股重挫人心惶惶！張菲「靠1操作」豪賺5億老神在在　笑稱：9位數對我來說很普通\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"鏡報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T03:37:00Z\",\"summary\":\"受到國際市場劇烈波動影響，台股上週五（16日）遭外資單日大舉調節逾3000億元，一舉刷新歷史單日賣超最高紀錄，讓今（19）日台股開盤前市場氣氛一片凝重、人心惶惶！不過，遇上大盤重挫，《綜藝大哥大》主持人張菲（菲哥）依然老神在在，他先前透露，自己手中曾握有20多支股票，市值破億，更靠著敏銳的市場直覺，在關鍵時刻「神操作」出清股票，一舉落袋至少5億元！\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/mirrordaily_390/557c8c0c215086dbba4ec35f6e7a7760.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1423DD9D631C74D459809B69EB05A08B4F85EB50B7A8E2EC747B6FF741D468D1/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrordaily_390%2F557c8c0c215086dbba4ec35f6e7a7760.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6DF54C9512FF3B2FA91945B74C8F73CB0675D3B8309EB98956107628FC1C492E/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrordaily_390%2F557c8c0c215086dbba4ec35f6e7a7760.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"台股重挫人心惶惶！張菲「靠1操作」豪賺5億老神在在　笑稱：9位數對我來說很普通\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"570f577b-dc69-369e-9fa1-501d1d402a32\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B6%85%E6%A8%A1%E8%80%81%E5%A9%86%E5%9B%9E%E6%AD%B8%E7%B6%AD%E5%AF%86-%E4%BD%95%E7%8C%B7%E5%90%9B%E7%94%9C%E5%96%8A-%E5%85%A8%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E9%A9%95%E5%82%B2-%E5%B0%8F%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E6%88%B4%E5%A4%A7%E7%BF%85%E8%86%80%E5%9B%9E%E4%BE%86%E4%BA%86-043000350.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":2},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B6%85%E6%A8%A1%E8%80%81%E5%A9%86%E5%9B%9E%E6%AD%B8%E7%B6%AD%E5%AF%86-%E4%BD%95%E7%8C%B7%E5%90%9B%E7%94%9C%E5%96%8A-%E5%85%A8%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E9%A9%95%E5%82%B2-%E5%B0%8F%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E6%88%B4%E5%A4%A7%E7%BF%85%E8%86%80%E5%9B%9E%E4%BE%86%E4%BA%86-043000350.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"1888aec0-c2e4-3870-b499-2dc71a393c0e\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"超模老婆回歸維密！　何猷君甜喊「全家人的驕傲」：小天使戴大翅膀回來了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"鏡週刊Mirror Media\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T04:30:00Z\",\"summary\":\"時尚盛宴維多利亞的秘密時尚秀（Victoria's Secret Fashion Show）在台灣時間今（19）日7時正式登場，澳門賭王何鴻燊四房之子何猷君的妻子奚夢瑤睽違8年上秀，讓粉絲相當驚喜。何猷君今天稍早也PO出老婆走秀的畫面，並甜喊，「妳是全家人的驕傲！小天使戴大翅膀回來了。」\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/mirrormedia.mg/af66ab764cee0d516a9fa813ed42b996.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1746CED77B3D808A5C73560026610B3D73FC25B4FA003252602513F514A12AAE/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2Faf66ab764cee0d516a9fa813ed42b996.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3FC7D1394A710A39425E212D9C68F87A8694C7499372882F9567091445448480/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2Faf66ab764cee0d516a9fa813ed42b996.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"超模老婆回歸維密！　何猷君甜喊「全家人的驕傲」：小天使戴大翅膀回來了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"1888aec0-c2e4-3870-b499-2dc71a393c0e\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%BD%E5%B8%82%E5%A4%9A-%E8%B2%B7%E7%86%9F%E9%A3%9F%E6%8E%83%E5%8D%A1%E6%96%B0%E5%88%B6-%E5%8D%8A%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E7%A0%B4%E5%8A%9F-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E8%AD%89%E5%AF%A6-%E6%95%B8%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%86%E5%BA%97%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88-055114415.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":4},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%BD%E5%B8%82%E5%A4%9A-%E8%B2%B7%E7%86%9F%E9%A3%9F%E6%8E%83%E5%8D%A1%E6%96%B0%E5%88%B6-%E5%8D%8A%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E7%A0%B4%E5%8A%9F-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E8%AD%89%E5%AF%A6-%E6%95%B8%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%86%E5%BA%97%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88-055114415.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"830d6f17-54f9-33a6-8521-311157cb622f\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"好市多「買熟食掃卡新制」半個月破功 官方證實：數家分店取消\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中時新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T05:51:14Z\",\"summary\":\"好市多10月起實施熟食區購餐前須先刷會員卡的新制，沒想到上路才半個月喊停，一名女子昨天到台南店買熟食，發現已不再要求出示會員卡，貼文曝光後，不少會員也回報，新莊、汐止、中和等分店也不必再刷卡。《中時新聞網》向業者求證，官方表示，部分門市熟食區調整會員卡查驗方式，若會員在入場時已完成會員驗證，熟食區將不再重複掃描會員卡。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/chinatimes.com.tw/7cb15dc73c17bf6c1d6a21a999bfb2c5.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/66FC5A548B212E6286E3C2BA6A73DE228418E9D0D94F2D7439E415BADFC19942/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fchinatimes.com.tw%2F7cb15dc73c17bf6c1d6a21a999bfb2c5.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/46268B0034EECC712625E3C4802E5F08521EF29C854D9CC93A0243B5DB549371/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fchinatimes.com.tw%2F7cb15dc73c17bf6c1d6a21a999bfb2c5.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"好市多「買熟食掃卡新制」半個月破功 官方證實：數家分店取消\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"830d6f17-54f9-33a6-8521-311157cb622f\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%80%99%E7%A8%AE%E8%82%89%E8%A6%81%E5%B0%91%E5%90%83-%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%832%E7%89%87-%E9%98%BF%E8%8C%B2%E6%B5%B7%E9%BB%98%E7%97%87-%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E9%A3%86%E5%8D%8752-043900862.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":10},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%80%99%E7%A8%AE%E8%82%89%E8%A6%81%E5%B0%91%E5%90%83-%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%832%E7%89%87-%E9%98%BF%E8%8C%B2%E6%B5%B7%E9%BB%98%E7%97%87-%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E9%A3%86%E5%8D%8752-043900862.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"7ea127bb-d7f3-3bb2-802c-1dc9c0a971c6\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"這種肉要少吃！每天吃2片「阿茲海默症」風險飆升52％\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-07T04:39:00Z\",\"summary\":\"最新研究指出，每天攝取約25公克加工肉品，可能提高罹患失智症與阿茲海默症風險，阿茲海默症風險更增加52％。專家建議，將日常10％超加工食品替換為未加工天然食物，有助降低失智風險。日常飲食應多攝取蔬果與富含Omega-3的魚類，守護大腦健康。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/88a3e5db4e341c7809da2b9617d78609.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D9D96660DA179A71C6FCED811ACE0520D94518D98D264D6371BEB00CE27CFEDC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F88a3e5db4e341c7809da2b9617d78609.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/30ED3A0CADF0D3094D86042109E6AB44A8B65A4AA74929448B33EFFD1917E2C1/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F88a3e5db4e341c7809da2b9617d78609.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"這種肉要少吃！每天吃2片「阿茲海默症」風險飆升52％\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"7ea127bb-d7f3-3bb2-802c-1dc9c0a971c6\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%80%B1%E4%BA%94%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E5%81%87%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B-%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91%E5%87%BA%E7%8F%BE%E8%AE%8A%E6%95%B8-%E5%90%B3%E8%81%96%E5%AE%87%E7%A4%BA%E8%AD%A6-%E9%9D%9E%E5%B8%B8%E6%8E%A5%E8%BF%91%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3-080700278.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":3},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%80%B1%E4%BA%94%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E5%81%87%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B-%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91%E5%87%BA%E7%8F%BE%E8%AE%8A%E6%95%B8-%E5%90%B3%E8%81%96%E5%AE%87%E7%A4%BA%E8%AD%A6-%E9%9D%9E%E5%B8%B8%E6%8E%A5%E8%BF%91%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3-080700278.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"37071290-a824-30cc-aeef-79046c185026\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"週五可能放颱風假？薔琵路徑出現變數　吳聖宇示警：非常接近台灣\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T08:09:00Z\",\"summary\":\"薔琵颱風路徑多變且北轉趨勢不如預期，氣象專家吳聖宇分析其可能往西偏折直逼台灣陸地，預計週五上午暴風圈將觸及海警線。受其影響，23至25日連假期間天氣衝擊恐難以避免，週五是否有機會放颱風假仍需視後續風雨標準而定，計畫出遊或返鄉的民眾務必隨時關注最新氣象資訊並保留行程彈性。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/4476104ccd3b565b8cc21449980fa0e4.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A51153164F25FA8CE7652DD71732BA01C4C135020B03EB3C24742E21C221E233/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F4476104ccd3b565b8cc21449980fa0e4.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/554956FD5188FDC2062608B082A948298A565E1C2360DFC2678B9BEE16FC8882/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F4476104ccd3b565b8cc21449980fa0e4.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"週五可能放颱風假？薔琵路徑出現變數　吳聖宇示警：非常接近台灣\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"37071290-a824-30cc-aeef-79046c185026\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B7%AF%E6%A8%B9%E6%82%B2%E6%AD%8C-%E6%A8%B9%E9%BD%A1%E8%B6%85%E9%81%8E30%E5%B9%B4-%E5%A3%AB%E6%9E%97-%E6%9D%8E%E7%99%BB%E8%BC%9D%E7%B8%BD%E7%B5%B1%E6%A8%B9-%E6%82%84%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%BB%E9%99%A4-030405734.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":93},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B7%AF%E6%A8%B9%E6%82%B2%E6%AD%8C-%E6%A8%B9%E9%BD%A1%E8%B6%85%E9%81%8E30%E5%B9%B4-%E5%A3%AB%E6%9E%97-%E6%9D%8E%E7%99%BB%E8%BC%9D%E7%B8%BD%E7%B5%B1%E6%A8%B9-%E6%82%84%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%BB%E9%99%A4-030405734.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"1e41d8b2-e3e1-3a11-9f51-8650f50442d6\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"【路樹悲歌】樹齡超過30年！士林「李登輝總統樹」悄被移除　北市府回應了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"太報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T04:14:09Z\",\"summary\":\"台北市士林美崙公園先前傳出市府擬砍119棵樹蓋停車場，消息曝光引發眾怒，市府緊急闢謠稱「尚未定案」，美崙公園老樹去留持續受到關注。台灣樹人會秘書長潘翰疆昨（18日）透露，美崙公園有2棵1995年時任總統李登輝與副總統李元簇為紀念首屆民選總統親手種植的老榕樹，今年10月查看只剩空樹穴，樹木與小立碑均遭移除，再度引發網路熱議。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/taisounds_com_380/559123780a7bcaa34d4304504202ffc0.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8CF11F057AEE0591F58779C46FA79E0EAC8391EA583B8EE3738B2C9714CEDCCA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F559123780a7bcaa34d4304504202ffc0.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/769A63B9386075650960B58A2B9A65FBC39C025DAB53D571C196DBC0423F4236/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F559123780a7bcaa34d4304504202ffc0.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"【路樹悲歌】樹齡超過30年！士林「李登輝總統樹」悄被移除　北市府回應了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"1e41d8b2-e3e1-3a11-9f51-8650f50442d6\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A4%A7%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E6%9D%BE%E4%BF%A1%E8%BB%8A%E6%8E%83%E8%A2%AB%E6%8F%AD%E9%9C%B2-%E4%BA%BA%E6%BD%AE%E7%A8%80%E7%96%8F-%E6%B0%91%E7%94%9F%E7%A4%BE%E5%8D%80%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%B6%E9%83%BD%E6%B2%92%E9%96%8B%E7%AA%97-123003580.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":129},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A4%A7%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E6%9D%BE%E4%BF%A1%E8%BB%8A%E6%8E%83%E8%A2%AB%E6%8F%AD%E9%9C%B2-%E4%BA%BA%E6%BD%AE%E7%A8%80%E7%96%8F-%E6%B0%91%E7%94%9F%E7%A4%BE%E5%8D%80%E4%BD%8F%E6%88%B6%E9%83%BD%E6%B2%92%E9%96%8B%E7%AA%97-123003580.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"durati