"canvass\":{\"count\":2},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%87%91%E9%90%9861-%E5%A4%8F%E5%AE%87%E7%AB%A5%E9%A0%92%E7%8D%8E%E7%8B%82%E9%A3%84%E5%AD%95%E5%91%B3-%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%8A%E6%94%BE%E9%96%83%E5%AD%AB%E5%8D%94%E5%BF%97-%E7%B6%93%E7%B4%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%81%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%9B%9E%E6%87%89-131500799.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"25efa0b1-3370-339e-95d2-5c3bb1e55247\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"金鐘61／夏宇童頒獎狂飄孕味！台上放閃孫協志　經紀人火速回應\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-17T13:15:00Z\",\"summary\":\"夏宇童與孫協志結婚後懷孕傳聞不斷，今出席廣播金鐘獎頒獎典禮因身形圓潤再度引發揣測，經紀人已火速否認。她與梁明達搭檔頒獎，更在台上大方幽默替孫協志所屬天團「5566」宣傳新歌甜蜜放閃。本屆廣播金鐘社會關懷及社區類獎項競爭激烈，最終由教育電臺及大千廣播電台等優秀節目與主持人分別抱走大獎。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/setn.com.tw/f4fdedf3b2c40fc1cd1698418e62a05f.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4F5CCC5804A098A231852DAB9692216C43221C88387E676396658C0A70FF9D50/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ff4fdedf3b2c40fc1cd1698418e62a05f.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E098C93E3E7A6516A6710648DED7BC0BF69878CF1B21222D262F4469ABBA7EDA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ff4fdedf3b2c40fc1cd1698418e62a05f.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"金鐘61／夏宇童頒獎狂飄孕味！台上放閃孫協志　經紀人火速回應\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"25efa0b1-3370-339e-95d2-5c3bb1e55247\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%8A%B18%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%B8%85%E5%87%BA%E6%95%B8%E5%99%B8%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE-%E7%94%B7%E6%95%B8%E9%80%B1%E5%BE%8C%E9%87%8D%E8%BF%94%E6%B2%B3%E9%82%8A%E5%B4%A9%E6%BD%B0%E5%82%BB%E7%9C%BC-%E5%85%A8%E7%99%BD%E8%B2%BB%E4%BA%86-070718083.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":2},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%8A%B18%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%B8%85%E5%87%BA%E6%95%B8%E5%99%B8%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE-%E7%94%B7%E6%95%B8%E9%80%B1%E5%BE%8C%E9%87%8D%E8%BF%94%E6%B2%B3%E9%82%8A%E5%B4%A9%E6%BD%B0%E5%82%BB%E7%9C%BC-%E5%85%A8%E7%99%BD%E8%B2%BB%E4%BA%86-070718083.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"dd6ee386-7920-3cc4-9157-5797eeda6343\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"花8個月清出數噸垃圾！男數週後重返河邊崩潰傻眼：全白費了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"CTWANT\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T07:07:18Z\",\"summary\":\"據印媒報導，這位環保人士名叫喬杜里（Surendra Singh Choudhary），又被稱為「比圖塔巴希」（Bittu Tabahi），過去因積極清理遭受污染的河川，在當地及社群平台累積不少粉絲關注。喬杜里先前將清理目標鎖定在印度中央邦拉傑加爾縣（Rajgarh）的阿吉納爾河（Ajnar River），...\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ctwant_com_582/d9519068f8a11757fdd343de69e29e81.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CD22F44DD31030945CC531481FD9DFC02D96AED93EFA7D14E4482C9516D1404B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fctwant_com_582%2Fd9519068f8a11757fdd343de69e29e81.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FE9D357E3259861A39639F26B2342CC9AA164DD0B28E17DB8470F42DAE74B18B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fctwant_com_582%2Fd9519068f8a11757fdd343de69e29e81.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"花8個月清出數噸垃圾！男數週後重返河邊崩潰傻眼：全白費了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"dd6ee386-7920-3cc4-9157-5797eeda6343\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%96%B0%E5%A9%9A%E5%A6%BB%E8%B7%AA%E6%B1%82%E9%86%AB%E5%B8%AB-%E5%86%8D%E6%95%91%E4%BB%96-31%E6%AD%B2%E7%94%B7%E6%84%9F%E5%86%922%E5%91%A8%E7%AB%9F%E7%8C%9D%E6%AD%BB-064729179.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":0},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%96%B0%E5%A9%9A%E5%A6%BB%E8%B7%AA%E6%B1%82%E9%86%AB%E5%B8%AB-%E5%86%8D%E6%95%91%E4%BB%96-31%E6%AD%B2%E7%94%B7%E6%84%9F%E5%86%922%E5%91%A8%E7%AB%9F%E7%8C%9D%E6%AD%BB-064729179.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"5b0472d7-053b-3818-a3dc-ef7623625be3\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"新婚妻跪求醫師「再救他」　31歲男感冒2周竟猝死\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中天新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T06:47:29Z\",\"summary\":\"臺安醫院心臟內科主任林謂文分享一名31歲男子感冒兩週後併發猛爆性心肌炎的遺憾病例，醫療團隊搶救逾兩小時仍回天乏術，他20多歲的新婚妻子在急診室當場跪地哭求醫師再搶救。林謂文提醒，病毒性心肌炎致死率極高，年輕健壯者也可能短時間內猝死，呼籲民眾接種流感疫苗以降低重症風險。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/gotv_ctitv_com_tw_678/5da28ab8b9c9ff6ff92f23db3dbc1537.png\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B5ECBACE7FA4EA83A80F046446201CE13ED60FAAB8FF04B581BF258E6BA8D0EE/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F5da28ab8b9c9ff6ff92f23db3dbc1537.png\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CB47F8685468782B85485F94BF452104C43527E8D5B133E80D5051C56DAA819D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F5da28ab8b9c9ff6ff92f23db3dbc1537.png\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"新婚妻跪求醫師「再救他」　31歲男感冒2周竟猝死\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"5b0472d7-053b-3818-a3dc-ef7623625be3\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A1%E5%BA%B7%E6%B0%B8%E9%A9%9A%E5%82%B3-%E4%B8%BB%E5%8B%95%E5%91%8A%E5%88%A5%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%B8%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4-%E8%A2%AB%E7%88%86%E5%88%AA%E9%99%A4%E5%B0%8D%E5%B2%B8%E7%B6%93%E7%B4%80%E4%BA%BA%E8%81%AF%E7%B9%AB%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F-005659160.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":142},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A1%E5%BA%B7%E6%B0%B8%E9%A9%9A%E5%82%B3-%E4%B8%BB%E5%8B%95%E5%91%8A%E5%88%A5%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%B8%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4-%E8%A2%AB%E7%88%86%E5%88%AA%E9%99%A4%E5%B0%8D%E5%B2%B8%E7%B6%93%E7%B4%80%E4%BA%BA%E8%81%AF%E7%B9%AB%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F-005659160.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"dbebdd01-5fa2-3c6d-8482-01fb4eaa1f28\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"蔡康永驚傳「主動告別大陸市場」！被爆刪除對岸經紀人聯繫方式\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中天新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T00:56:59Z\",\"summary\":\"主持人蔡康永近日出席沈伯洋的選舉造勢活動引發網路熱議，微博隨後傳出他已刪除大陸經紀人聯絡方式，外界猜測他可能淡出大陸市場。截至目前，蔡康永本人尚未對相關傳聞公開回應，傳聞是否屬實仍有待他進一步說明。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/gotv_ctitv_com_tw_678/2d0f85056b9c1e6e3e511f26bacb8274.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E92781BBD614F09225B60923B629DB94D4A19DD1EEFC535B6E00CCD329199717/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F2d0f85056b9c1e6e3e511f26bacb8274.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4FBAC2E7EE5AB0740AF3AE39EA7EC82A43C6DC7D846C1EE894C45157056B0B53/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F2d0f85056b9c1e6e3e511f26bacb8274.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"蔡康永驚傳「主動告別大陸市場」！被爆刪除對岸經紀人聯繫方式\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"dbebdd01-5fa2-3c6d-8482-01fb4eaa1f28\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A6%9E%E5%A6%9E%E4%BF%83%E9%83%AD%E6%9B%BE%E7%A0%B4%E5%86%B0-%E9%83%AD%E5%AE%B63%E8%B1%AA%E8%8F%AF%E5%BA%A7%E9%A7%95%E5%85%A8%E5%87%BA%E5%8B%95-16%E6%AD%B2%E5%A6%9E%E5%A6%9E%E5%8A%9B%E4%BF%83%E7%88%B8%E5%AA%BD%E4%B8%96%E7%B4%80%E5%90%88%E9%AB%94-%E9%80%99%E5%A4%A9%E4%BA%AE%E7%9B%B8-222859539.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":14},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A6%9E%E5%A6%9E%E4%BF%83%E9%83%AD%E6%9B%BE%E7%A0%B4%E5%86%B0-%E9%83%AD%E5%AE%B63%E8%B1%AA%E8%8F%AF%E5%BA%A7%E9%A7%95%E5%85%A8%E5%87%BA%E5%8B%95-16%E6%AD%B2%E5%A6%9E%E5%A6%9E%E5%8A%9B%E4%BF%83%E7%88%B8%E5%AA%BD%E4%B8%96%E7%B4%80%E5%90%88%E9%AB%94-%E9%80%99%E5%A4%A9%E4%BA%AE%E7%9B%B8-222859539.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"cbd76e20-0f29-3359-98bd-859fa2af4563\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"妞妞促郭曾破冰／郭家3豪華座駕全出動　16歲妞妞力促爸媽世紀合體「這天亮相」\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"鏡週刊Mirror Media\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T22:28:59Z\",\"summary\":\"由永齡基金會主辦、曾馨瑩主理的「永齡銘馨盃」舞蹈大賽邁入第四屆，據悉，她16歲的女兒妞妞過往只是插花演出，今年開始加入主導賽事，而且正在撮合爸爸郭台銘與媽媽曾馨瑩同台，一番孝心正是想讓爸媽世紀破冰，畢竟近來有了職業小三謝女的介入，導致一家氣氛既尷尬又令人不寒而慄。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/mirrormedia.mg/f5ea3bb43f1be1e443b57332f029c961.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B4E02D0CA3A24E2651C6ACA2F5C62748AAB472B73522971E2C76B81E5CA15102/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2Ff5ea3bb43f1be1e443b57332f029c961.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FCF0CEAB054C996273F6C5B9BB5B2EFEE61F268B3AD85BCF367A3AD5895E41BA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2Ff5ea3bb43f1be1e443b57332f029c961.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"妞妞促郭曾破冰／郭家3豪華座駕全出動　16歲妞妞力促爸媽世紀合體「這天亮相」\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"cbd76e20-0f29-3359-98bd-859fa2af4563\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%A5%BF%E9%96%80%E7%94%BA%E7%94%9C%E7%94%9C%E5%9C%88%E7%88%86%E8%82%A2%E9%AB%94%E8%A1%9D%E7%AA%81-%E5%BA%97%E5%93%A1-%E8%B7%B3%E5%87%BA%E6%AB%83%E5%8F%B0-%E7%97%9B%E6%AF%86%E5%A4%A7%E5%AA%BD-%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E6%8E%92%E9%9A%8A%E7%8F%BE%E6%B3%81%E6%9B%9D-011400574.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":102},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%A5%BF%E9%96%80%E7%94%BA%E7%94%9C%E7%94%9C%E5%9C%88%E7%88%86%E8%82%A2%E9%AB%94%E8%A1%9D%E7%AA%81-%E5%BA%97%E5%93%A1-%E8%B7%B3%E5%87%BA%E6%AB%83%E5%8F%B0-%E7%97%9B%E6%AF%86%E5%A4%A7%E5%AA%BD-%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E6%8E%92%E9%9A%8A%E7%8F%BE%E6%B3%81%E6%9B%9D-011400574.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"3f6573bc-26db-39e4-a2f7-fce129733c76\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"西門町甜甜圈爆肢體衝突！店員「跳出櫃台」痛毆大媽　最新排隊現況曝\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T01:14:00Z\",\"summary\":\"台北西門町知名甜甜圈店日前因顧客插隊與言語挑釁，引爆店員與客人的激烈肢體衝突，過程全被拍下並在網路上引發熱議。店家事後坦承動手不當並致歉，但也強調維護排隊秩序與員工安全的立場。然而，這起事件曝光後非但沒有影響生意，反而吸引大批民眾前往朝聖排隊力挺，讓該店在一夕之間爆紅成為話題焦點。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/setn.com.tw/d8cd1ef4decec3cdaef1667cb9b343b5.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ABE6B295D2DE686666282691FF733607DD464778F449FFB4DDC20E9850547419/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fd8cd1ef4dece