老人、全家族30多人無前科，深怕因此留下紀錄，且不願將剩餘時光耗費於漫長訴訟，也期盼外界不要誤解處事公正的承審法官。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/gotv_ctitv_com_tw_678/72ee644a40cd915ae32f7c9b98f9934f.png\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/60DAE75C68008A97768B56DD821E130CF49D369E914D4D1F7CE4D7C93D158419/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F72ee644a40cd915ae32f7c9b98f9934f.png\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5F873A9EFE7FAA0DD046D2150BF2B48713DB1F2ED7D72448B809EFD6FF5BCCC4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F72ee644a40cd915ae32f7c9b98f9934f.png\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"北捷扶婦挨告11萬和解「怕留前科」　退休教授發聲挺法官\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"0bbd952b-fdff-3435-bad8-bb444fc44c7d\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/gd-%E5%A4%96%E7%94%A5%E5%82%BB%E7%93%9C-%E5%86%8D%E6%B7%BB%E7%96%BC%E6%84%9B%E5%B0%8D%E8%B1%A1-%E5%A7%8A%E5%A7%8A%E6%AC%8A%E5%A4%9A%E7%BE%8E%E7%AC%AC2%E8%83%8E%E5%A5%B3%E5%85%92%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%89%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F-%E5%AF%B6%E5%AF%B6%E7%85%A7%E5%85%AC%E9%96%8B-052500510.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":1},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/gd-%E5%A4%96%E7%94%A5%E5%82%BB%E7%93%9C-%E5%86%8D%E6%B7%BB%E7%96%BC%E6%84%9B%E5%B0%8D%E8%B1%A1-%E5%A7%8A%E5%A7%8A%E6%AC%8A%E5%A4%9A%E7%BE%8E%E7%AC%AC2%E8%83%8E%E5%A5%B3%E5%85%92%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%89%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F-%E5%AF%B6%E5%AF%B6%E7%85%A7%E5%85%AC%E9%96%8B-052500510.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":