defined\",\"id\":\"ffb46140-0af6-30ef-a120-e67ee3b4cfdd\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T07:22:23Z\",\"summary\":\"即時中心／潘柏廷報導民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋，投入選戰以來，藉由掃街拜票、流利口才點出現今市政問題，再加上接受非同溫層的資深媒體人王偉忠等人專訪，逐漸在首都掀起「洋流」旋風；甚至在最新民調顯示，他與對手、國民黨籍市長蔣萬安僅差8%，引發各界高度關注。對此，資深媒體人黃暐瀚今（19）日在臉書指出，只要3者到位，沈伯洋將是11月28日的台北市長當選人。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftvn.com.tw/55aab8f145b4e6a4938645bafcddcb1f.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CF457F55D078D1C2646BC8B8FB2C164A2A5C6AA6B5EC34F499B989C184CE4950/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F55aab8f145b4e6a4938645bafcddcb1f.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7B83FBE685E1756848E9C5854F7919040E9647DF4DC980AF32CE17D6FF4BEE8C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F55aab8f145b4e6a4938645bafcddcb1f.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"ffb46140-0af6-30ef-a120-e67ee3b4cfdd\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E8%81%B2%E5%8B%A2%E6%B5%A9%E5%A4%A7%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%A3%E7%A5%A8-%E9%86%AB%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80-%E7%B6%A0%E7%87%9F%E6%81%90-%E5%B1%8D%E5%A4%9A%E5%91%BD-060630845.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":82},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E8%81%B2%E5%8B%A2%E6%B5%A9%E5%A4%A7%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%A3%E7%A5%A8-%E9%86%AB%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80-%E7%B6%A0%E7%87%9F%E6%81%90-%E5%B1%8D%E5%A4%9A%E5%91%BD-060630845.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"08c0c541-dec5-3520-99ca-33ad16f52d0d\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"風傳媒\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T06:06:30Z\",\"summary\":\"2026九合一選戰進入倒數階段，台北市長選情白熱化，民進黨參選人沈伯洋近來掃街、造勢所到之處人潮洶湧，被認為是「洋流崛起」。不過，胸腔科醫師蘇一峰在臉書發文表示，「洋流全台亂衝」無法轉化成選票，恐導致綠營「一屍多命」，新北市長參選人蘇巧慧成最大苦主。針對近來洋流崛起的討論，蘇一峰直言，洋流亂衝無法轉化為選票，綠營恐面臨一屍多命。洋流熱潮壓縮其他縣市綠營聲量，......\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/stormmediagroup.com/27d3d539f373becba84201e3050354f5\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/BC813077BB6D70A662E2204FA875B1007D59E731CB6A6CA873C6C4E5028667B4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fstormmediagroup.com%2F27d3d539f373becba84201e3050354f5\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FC9ED3D2B4770EC489E936EE5D4C8A0A6FF79F28733ADD263BE87CC9F8046D8B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fstormmediagroup.com%2F27d3d539f373becba84201e3050354f5\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"08c0c541-dec5-3520-99ca-33ad16f52d0d\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E6%9C%80%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%B1%E5%9B%9B%E7%99%BC%E6%B5%B7%E8%AD%A6-%E5%8C%97%E8%BD%89%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91-%E5%88%863%E6%B4%BE-%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%8E%E9%98%B2%E9%A2%A8%E9%9B%A8-060600322.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":14},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E6%9C%80%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%B1%E5%9B%9B%E7%99%BC%E6%B5%B7%E8%AD%A6-%E5%8C%97%E8%BD%89%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91-%E5%88%863%E6%B4%BE-%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%8E%E9%98%B2%E9%A2%A8%E9%9B%A8-060600322.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"c69fd3b9-07ec-315d-9cc0-7c5c47e4b082\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"上報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T06:06:00Z\",\"summary\":\"今年第29號颱風「薔琵」（Champi）持續向台灣附近海域靠近。氣象粉專「台灣颱風論壇｜天氣特急」今（19日）指出，強颱薔琵在經歷眼牆置換與乾空氣捲入後，核心結構正重新建立，原本模糊\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/upmedia.mg.tw/5c2ec9ff808c6488076a2e1e474f284f.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3A78A7BFDB5C58E705E286A33316C5801FB889DF3B2053FAE8E5C394DCE00B3B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fupmedia.mg.tw%2F5c2ec9ff808c6488076a2e1e474f284f.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E68A0A7488FFD5BFE91281F066DEC9DA4E3C4952E568B4794D7CB95C8AF72A82/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fupmedia.mg.tw%2F5c2ec9ff808c6488076a2e1e474f284f.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"c69fd3b9-07ec-315d-9cc0-7c5c47e4b082\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9F%AF%E6%96%87%E5%93%B2%E5%AE%8C%E8%9B%8B%E4%BA%86-%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%B3%E6%88%BF%E6%9D%8E%E6%96%87%E5%AE%97%E8%AA%8D%E7%BD%AA%E8%88%87%E6%9F%AF%E6%8E%8F%E7%A9%BA%E7%9C%BE%E6%9C%9B%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E6%9C%83-070800907.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":18},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9F%AF%E6%96%87%E5%93%B2%E5%AE%8C%E8%9B%8B%E4%BA%86-%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%B3%E6%88%BF%E6%9D%8E%E6%96%87%E5%AE%97%E8%AA%8D%E7%BD%AA%E8%88%87%E6%9F%AF%E6%8E%8F%E7%A9%BA%E7%9C%BE%E6%9C%9B%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E6%9C%83-070800907.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"1e797b2b-c2ec-3d2c-b029-b74ee603f49b\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"鏡週刊Mirror Media\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T07:08:00Z\",\"summary\":\"高等法院今（19日）針對民眾黨前主席柯文哲涉及侵佔政治獻及掏空眾望基金會案再度開庭，李文宗確定認罪，坦承與柯文哲挪用眾望基金會公款210萬元給柯文哲的貼身帳房許芷瑜（橘子、潛逃通緝中）、黃心緗等4個未到基金會工作，實際從事柯競選活動人員。此外李文娟也傳出有意認罪。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/mirrormedia.mg/11