provider\":{\"displayName\":\"FTNN新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T06:58:00Z\",\"summary\":\"[FTNN新聞網]記者胡家銘／台北報導九合一選戰倒數，台北市長選情成全國最熱焦點，爭取連任的台北市長蔣萬安市政爭議不斷，民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋以「洋...\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftnn_com_tw_939/33d1f95f70e12fa62cc0567f3f5ba2e6.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/83BC3160EE4A0F9AFAF00239D9DC6D8D59EC4C91E2B9632FBE866F69E826022B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftnn_com_tw_939%2F33d1f95f70e12fa62cc0567f3f5ba2e6.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/970D7FE0496867D62248E586959143D660794D658C816B9B0E3BC2EA2B12A1BA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftnn_com_tw_939%2F33d1f95f70e12fa62cc0567f3f5ba2e6.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"3133ced5-69b3-3881-9c0d-4a7404cd13eb\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%98%87%E5%A7%BF%E4%B8%B0%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E9%A9%9A%E5%96%9C%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB-%E8%81%BD%E9%80%99%E6%AE%B5-%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%8B%82%E6%86%8B%E6%B7%9A-%E7%B6%B2%E7%9C%8B%E5%93%AD%E4%BA%86-142114398.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":65},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%98%87%E5%A7%BF%E4%B8%B0%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E9%A9%9A%E5%96%9C%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB-%E8%81%BD%E9%80%99%E6%AE%B5-%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%8B%82%E6%86%8B%E6%B7%9A-%E7%B6%B2%E7%9C%8B%E5%93%AD%E4%BA%86-142114398.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"7016aa05-2539-3e46-a232-64a3ccfe05e6\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"蘇姿丰父親驚喜現身！聽這段「沈伯洋狂憋淚」網看哭了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T14:21:14Z\",\"summary\":\"政治中心／周希雯報導九合一大選決戰日逼近，民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋帶著「台北大洋流號」，今（18日）第二站重磅來到「本命區」，前進松山、信義選區，並在終點站民權公園舉行造勢活動。沒想到除了行政院長卓榮泰親自到場力挺，超微（AMD）董事長暨執行長蘇姿丰的父親、總統府資政蘇春槐，更作為神秘來賓驚喜現身，在台上發言時滿懷溫情與期許，令沈伯洋多次望著他哽咽，許多看直播的網友也動容，「他在忍著不哭」\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/ftvn.com.tw/48e3bde343103c4c7c181eb7124d2d36.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/76F47705F6965C0372A87E88EDAF7501A9AEF58406EFEBE041E4A535B31090E6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F48e3bde343103c4c7c181eb7124d2d36.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B1FFCD30014BD347303DBDE81ECC3F8E85F8F29940A99EFBD2CAC08125D61A5C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F48e3bde343103c4c7c181eb7124d2d36.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"蘇姿丰父親驚喜現身！聽這段「沈伯洋狂憋淚」網看哭了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"7016aa05-2539-3e46-a232-64a3ccfe05e6\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7%E9%81%B8%E6%88%B0%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E5%87%BA%E7%88%90-%E9%80%99%E4%BA%BA-%E9%A0%98%E5%85%88%E8%BF%91%E5%85%A9%E6%88%90%E7%A2%BE%E5%A3%93%E5%B0%8D%E6%89%8B-233436340.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":122},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7%E9%81%B8%E6%88%B0%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E5%87%BA%E7%88%90-%E9%80%99%E4%BA%BA-%E9%A0%98%E5%85%88%E8%BF%91%E5%85%A9%E6%88%90%E7%A2%BE%E5%A3%93%E5%B0%8D%E6%89%8B-233436340.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"9199b37c-74f9-3889-bba5-3cd5a77da3ec\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手...\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"Newtalk新聞\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:34:36Z\",\"summary\":\"[Newtalk新聞] 距離九合一選舉提票日剩四十日。其中，在台北市市長選戰部分，國民黨由現任市長蔣萬安拼連任；民進黨則由立委沈伯洋應戰。根據一項最新調查，「這人」竟近領先近兩成碾壓對手。 《壹蘋新聞網》近日發起以「倒數6週，你支持誰當台北市長？」為題之網路投票，投票時間為本月11日至16日止，共有5,045人參與。結果顯示，沈伯洋以56.1%居首；蔣萬安以41.5%居次；另有2.4%表示「尚未決定」。沈伯洋與蔣萬安兩人支持度相差14.7個百分點。 不過，網路投票涉及的不確定因素極多，至多只能作為觀察網友態度的參考，較難作為判斷實際選舉輿情的依據。若要關注相關選舉輿情變化，建議仍應參考各家民調機構、媒體民調中心，或委託專業民調機構所進行的民意調查。查看原文更多Newtalk新聞報導沈伯洋很氣「我是犯罪學所長」 蔣萬安：你專業是認知作戰 沈伯洋：我是「認知作戰」專家、但蔣萬安跟我應是同一國人\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/newtalk.tw/915e0fad10c3a164b621626ee05ef190.png\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D6A31826242793FC70E8965797412272288F98BBF1BEA211D747903ED1F3D39A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F915e0fad10c3a164b621626ee05ef190.png\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/92BE382674850A838109CD1FA065AF4C44846FFC79DC0B2A67A6E2B00F3AB513/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F915e0fad10c3a164b621626ee05ef190.png\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手...\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"9199b37c-74f9-3889-bba5-3cd5a77da3ec\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A4%A7%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E8%99%9F-%E7%B6%93%E6%B0%91%E7%94%9F%E7%A4%BE%E5%8D%80-%E6%A8%93%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%BD%91%E6%B0%B4-%E8%AD%A6%E6%9B%9D%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E7%B5%90%E6%9E%9C-075600778.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":4},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A4%A7%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E8%99%9F-%E7%B6%93%E6%B0%91%E7%94%9F%E7%A4%BE%E5%8D%80-%E6%A8%93%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%BD%91%E6%B0%B4-%E8%AD%A6%E6%9B%9D%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E7%B5%90%E6%9E%9C-075600778.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"8c7898fd-afc7-3ca1-8f97-e0faa1e7044a\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"沈伯洋「大洋流號」經民生社區　樓上有人潑水！警曝調查結果\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"壹蘋新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T07:56:00Z\",\"summary\":\"【記者江孟謙／台北報導】民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋「大洋流號」昨天（18日）經過松山區民生社區，疑似有住戶從高樓灑水，被「小水滴」譏諷「真的是非常有水準」。轄區警方還原當時狀況以及處理情形。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/nextapple_com_761/51c9320ea2d74f3d55727a92ff6996dc\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2F4FBC68EEDF4AB6C0934EB2157B941640EB42DC47776540F9337A9366A06E29/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnextapple_com_761%2F51c9320ea2d74f3d55727a92ff6996dc\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/488765CE489344591570AE6702E277EA7677B1D6DA359C946CC748C5682D7389/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnextapple_com_761%2F51c9320ea2d74f3d55727a92ff6996dc\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"沈伯洋「大洋流號」經民生社區　樓上有人潑水！警曝調查結果\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"8c7898fd-afc7-3ca1-8f97-e0faa1e7044a\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B7%B1%E8%97%8D%E5%A4%96%E7%9C%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BB%A3-%E6%B1%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%94%B9%E6%8A%95%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E6%9B%9D1%E9%97%9C%E9%8D%B5-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E7%AB%9F%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E5%9B%9B%E7%8D%B8%E5%B1%B1-022800500.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":170},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B7%B1%E8%97%8D%E5%A4%96%E7%9C%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BB%A3-%E6%B1%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%94%B9%E6%8A%95%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E6%9B%9D1%E9%97%9C%E9%8D%B5-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E7%AB%9F%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E5%9B%9B%E7%8D%B8%E5%B1%B1-022800500.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"a124ad9b-b2df-36bc-b7d9-78d7e5a2009c\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T02:28:00Z\",\"summary\":\"2026台北市長選戰白熱化，尋求連任的蔣萬安與民進黨參選人沈伯洋競爭激烈。近日傳出深藍選區的外省第三代民眾「票投轉向」，表態改支持沈伯洋。該名民眾指出，主因在於蔣萬安先前竟答不出信義區著名的「四獸山」包含哪四座山，讓身為在地居民的她感到相當錯愕與失望。此外，談及近期發生的兒虐事件時，她也哽咽表示市民期望看到領導者能真正站出來承擔家長心聲，成為社會的安全後盾。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/setn.com.tw/6c42e63403c0df12b7c31ad63e7f350e.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/040FA89B9E9B79E3C3ACDC6095C5143E123B3943953CD3D9D5ABA5DCFDFD0C9E/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F6c42e63403c0df12b7c31ad63e7f350e.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A3BEB2B1C25296445C0E13D81A76B88B342E4A70B6BEF1F2E6399F4D9A0DA090/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F6c42e63403c0df12b7c31ad63e7f350e.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"a124ad9b-b2df-36bc-b7d9-78d7e5a2009c\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E8%BB%8A%E6%8E%83%E9%A9%9A%E8%A6%8B-%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E5%85%92%E5%AD%90%E7%AA%81%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB-%E8%87%AA%E7%88%86-%E7%88%B6%E5%AD%90%E5%85%A7%E5%B9%95-%E7%B6%B2%E8%A2%AB%E6%9A%96%E5%93%AD-082449869.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":14},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E8%BB%8A%E6%8E%83%E9%A9%9A%E8%A6%8B-%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E5%85%92%E5%AD%90%E7%AA%81%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB-%E8%87%AA%E7%88%86-%E7%88%B6%E5%AD%90%E5%85%A7%E5%B9%95-%E7%B6%B2%E8%A2%AB%E6%9A%96%E5%93%AD-082449869.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"dbdfa07b-391c-3a69-b14c-c2bf5b2aadc5\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"洋流車掃驚見「沈伯洋兒子突現身」！自爆「父子內幕」網被暖哭\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T08:24:49Z\",\"summary\":\"政治中心／綜合報導隨著2026九合一大選決戰日逼近，民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋「台北大洋流號」今（18日）第二站前進松山、信義選區，車隊還沒正式出發，年僅26歲的民進黨市議員參選人郭凡就提前現身，與當地民眾互動，沒想到郭凡接受現場訪問時，竟意外揭露自己與44歲沈伯洋的特殊淵源，原來兩人不只是同樣在松山、信義長大，還都是「復興寶寶」，沈伯洋更是他的大學長，談到日前沈伯洋替他站台時，被外界笑稱根本是「沈爸爸」上身，郭凡當場害羞笑出來「1句話認了」。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftvn.com.tw/0c2e8becfab592dd37ad5120b36d6ddf.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A5C10CAFF8BA3664671F0717B0AFE6EE2074E64805C4CDFA2E3FE53A4ED127A7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F0c2e8becfab592dd37ad5120b36d6ddf.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/C186F99B5BD0ED83B5954CC9FD2AAF3A646C54E263BAB890955B086BCD46A808/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F0c2e8becfab592dd37ad5120b36d6ddf.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"洋流車掃驚見「沈伯洋兒子突現身」！自爆「父子內幕」網被暖哭\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"dbdfa07b-391c-3a69-b14c-c2bf5b2aadc5\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%9F%93%E5%9C%8B%E7%91%9C%E5%96%8A%E8%93%8B%E8%90%AC%E9%87%8C%E9%95%B7%E5%9F%8E-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%86%E5%BE%80-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%80%92%E5%97%86-%E8%AA%AA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E9%AC%BC-011745811.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":136},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%9F%93%E5%9C%8B%E7%91%9C%E5%96%8A%E8%93%8B%E8%90%AC%E9%87%8C%E9%95%B7%E5%9F%8E-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%86%E5%BE%80-%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%80%92%E5%97%86-%E8%AA%AA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E9%AC%BC-011745811.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"cadd4be2-ca04-3e95-a85b-2562e8f17213\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"韓國瑜喊蓋萬里長城「高雄台南不來往」！高雄人怒嗆：說什麼鬼\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T01:17:45Z\",\"summary\":\"政治中心／楊佩怡報導高雄市長選戰進入白熱化階段，17日晚間藍綠兩營各自舉行大型造勢活動，隔空較勁意味濃厚。民進黨高雄市長參選人賴瑞隆成立競選總部，邀請黨內高層重磅力挺；國民黨參選人柯志恩則舉辦廟口開講，力邀立法院長韓國瑜重返港都站台。然而，韓國瑜在致詞時拋出「台南與高雄之間蓋萬里長城」的言論，迅速引發高雄網友怒轟：「到底誰讓他當立法院長的」。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftvn.com.tw/fa62ef3722505d4549a8fd69d2b9931b.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/17660D1A4B0DCAEEBF4C19AD680384041573567445DC4AABC16336F44AA01D72/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Ffa62ef3722505d4549a8fd69d2b9931b.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7F5EB0D982FA45C2D399FA4F67FEE21BA08AF6070223709EB62BEBEDA3BB55BD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Ffa62ef3722505d4549a8fd69d2b9931b.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"韓國瑜喊蓋萬里長城「高雄台南不來往」！高雄人怒嗆：說什麼鬼\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"cadd4be2-ca04-3e95-a85b-2562e8f17213\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E6%9B%87%E8%8A%B1-%E7%8F%BE-%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%B8%AB%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80%E7%B5%90%E5%B1%80-%E5%BE%85%E6%BD%AE%E6%B0%B4%E8%A4%AA%E5%8E%BB%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%8C-131008526.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":25},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E6%9B%87%E8%8A%B1-%E7%8F%BE-%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%B8%AB%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80%E7%B5%90%E5%B1%80-%E5%BE%85%E6%BD%AE%E6%B0%B4%E8%A4%AA%E5%8E%BB%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%8C-131008526.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"692a79ae-cf15-3865-9211-e7afb833664e\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中時新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T13:10:08Z\",\"summary\":\"民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋掀起「洋流」，他日前接受媒體專訪，當場拿出隨身攜帶的塔羅牌，親自替選戰最後40多天的發展占卜。針對「洋流」，命理專家、吠陀占星權威李靜唯表示，熱鬧的浪花或許能博得一時的關注，但潮水褪去之後，唯有禁得起泥土檢驗的踏實治理與寬容厚度，才能真正承載一座城市的未來。。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[]},\"title\":\"「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"692a79ae-cf15-3865-9211-e7afb833664e\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BE%90%E5%B7%A7%E8%8A%AF-%E7%8C%9B%E9%96%8B%E6%88%B0%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E9%81%AD%E5%8F%8D%E6%AE%BA-%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%9F%E5%A5%B3%E6%AD%8C%E6%89%8B%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8B%E5%8E%BB%E7%94%A91%E5%8F%A5%E5%A4%A7%E7%97%9B%E6%93%8A-020328563.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":159},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BE%90%E5%B7%A7%E8%8A%AF-%E7%8C%9B%E9%96%8B%E6%88%B0%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E9%81%AD%E5%8F%8D%E6%AE%BA-%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%9F%E5%A5%B3%E6%AD%8C%E6%89%8B%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8B%E5%8E%BB%E7%94%A91%E5%8F%A5%E5%A4%A7%E7%97%9B%E6%93%8A-020328563.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"3c3fb3f6-fbcd-3edb-9a26-b24d4cfebe33\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T02:03:28Z\",\"summary\":\"政治中心／綜合報導2026台北市長選戰持續升溫，國民黨立委徐巧芯18日受訪時，將矛頭指向民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋，批評他擔任立委期間沒有為台北市爭取建設，甚至直指沈伯洋「沒有政績、只有人設」，沒想到，相關言論曝光後，歌手謝和弦的妻子陳緗妮也在臉書發文，翻出沈伯洋過去擔任不分區立委的責任區其實是花蓮縣，發文反問：「徐巧芯為什麼要問沈伯洋為台北市做了什麼？蛤？？？？」。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftvn.com.tw/820f6372fc66a6f5ab034ff79586a3ec.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/365554FE4971F1C6FD5D71A2862BE12ED0BB59772133886F580E88282F849302/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F820f6372fc66a6f5ab034ff79586a3ec.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/EC560C92651E17F24190A3E6DE31F234775BE2BA681A3100B7DB9C28637DF8D9/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F820f6372fc66a6f5ab034ff79586a3ec.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"3c3fb3f6-fbcd-3edb-9a26-b24d4cfebe33\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E9%81%AD8%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%96%E8%A1%8C%E6%9A%B4%E6%89%93%E8%B8%B9%E4%B8%8B%E9%AB%94-%E6%B6%89%E6%A1%88%E5%AD%B8%E7%94%9F%E4%BB%8A%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD-074700463.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":0},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E9%81%AD8%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%96%E8%A1%8C%E6%9A%B4%E6%89%93%E8%B8%B9%E4%B8%8B%E9%AB%94-%E6%B6%89%E6%A1%88%E5%AD%B8%E7%94%9F%E4%BB%8A%E7%A7%BB%E9%80%81%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD-074700463.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"f70948d1-1a31-339b-9aa5-8386856c5fff\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"EBC東森新聞\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T07:47:00Z\",\"summary\":\"桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ebc.net.tw/3d525e022d7cd5fd2f6ef01c5322de57.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/DA48B2E9A392AFF21D63317DD76B840986881A8B9889B40DDDDC66FDD8657028/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Febc.net.tw%2F3d525e022d7cd5fd2f6ef01c5322de57.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F043BB5276C5490200B52803ED384FF83C38A42F72AA058F3979D7470E2522F6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Febc.net.tw%2F3d525e022d7cd5fd2f6ef01c5322de57.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"桃園少年遭8人拖行暴打踹下體！涉案學生今移送少年法庭\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"f70948d1-1a31-339b-9aa5-8386856c5fff\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E7%A9%A9%E6%93%8D%E5%8B%9D%E5%88%B8-%E6%97%85%E7%BE%8E%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E7%94%A8%E5%93%88%E4%BD%9B%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%8E%A8%E4%BC%B0-%E9%A9%9A%E6%9B%9D%E8%97%8D%E7%B6%A06%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8B%9D%E7%8E%87-234023775.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":11},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E7%A9%A9%E6%93%8D%E5%8B%9D%E5%88%B8-%E6%97%85%E7%BE%8E%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E7%94%A8%E5%93%88%E4%BD%9B%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%8E%A8%E4%BC%B0-%E9%A9%9A%E6%9B%9D%E8%97%8D%E7%B6%A06%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8B%9D%E7%8E%87-234023775.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"13eb27b1-8897-350d-b5a0-0bec802df457\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"蔣萬安穩操勝券？旅美教授用哈佛模型推估 驚曝藍綠6都最新勝率\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中時新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:40:23Z\",\"summary\":\"2026九合一選舉將於11月28日登場，六都市長選戰進入最後倒數，究竟藍綠版圖會不會重新洗牌？旅美教授翁履中18日在臉書分享最新選情分析，參考哈佛大學教授Gary King研究團隊的選舉預測方法，結合2010年以來六都選舉資料及今年47份公開民調進行推估。結果顯示，六都最可能維持「藍4綠2」格局，國民黨在台北、桃園及台中領先，民進黨則在台南、高雄占優，新北市成為最大變數。至於外界關注的「洋流」能否撼動台北市長蔣萬安，翁履中推估，納入現任優勢等因素後，民進黨候選人沈伯洋的勝率約落在1至2成，但仍有翻盤可能。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[]},\"title\":\"蔣萬安穩操勝券？旅美教授用哈佛模型推估 驚曝藍綠6都最新勝率\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"13eb27b1-8897-350d-b5a0-0bec802df457\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%AA%8D%E4%BA%86-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%90%BD%E9%81%B8-%E6%B2%88%E5%AF%8C%E9%9B%84-%E5%BE%88%E5%83%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%97%A5%E8%90%BD%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%86-%E5%A4%95%E9%99%BD%E4%BA%86-011304091.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":104},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%AA%8D%E4%BA%86-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%90%BD%E9%81%B8-%E6%B2%88%E5%AF%8C%E9%9B%84-%E5%BE%88%E5%83%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%97%A5%E8%90%BD%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%86-%E5%A4%95%E9%99%BD%E4%BA%86-011304091.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"3020e32c-1359-3060-ad06-eab058e15fd3\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"認了「蔣萬安有可能落選」沈富雄：很像要日落西山了、夕陽了 你知道嗎？\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"Newtalk新聞\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T01:49:34Z\",\"summary\":\"[Newtalk新聞] 九合一地方選舉將於下月舉行，民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋掀起「洋流」聲勢驚人，積極破圈也讓國民黨不少人開始緊張。前立委沈富雄前幾天才和「戰鬥藍」發起人趙少康在節目上因專訪沈伯洋發生爭論，18日又在同場來賓國民黨台北市議員李柏毅和國民黨立委葉元之面前脫口直言，看到目前「洋流」的態勢，現任市長蔣萬安「有可能落選」，引發熱烈討論。 沈富雄先前在《少康戰情室》節目中至少兩度批評「綜藝教父」王偉忠和趙少康專訪沈伯洋是在幫助對手破圈，直指沈伯洋擺明是有目的性的想找藍營節目、不是什麼「善類」。趙少康當場反駁，身為媒體人，藍綠白的人選都應該可以邀請，善盡訪問責任，不應把選情不振歸咎於媒體。當沈富雄還想繼續爭辯，趙少康還不耐煩打斷，讓節目進廣告。 沈富雄18日上《TVBS戰情室》坦言：「現在我必須講，辯論還沒開始，大家就已經看好沈伯洋，這個危機非常的深啊！原來我是以為沈伯洋只有在媒體、電視、廣播佔上風，這個就差不多了，現在不是耶！這段我是要講給柏毅還有元之聽的，我跟你講，蔣萬安有可能落選！有可能落選！」 沈富雄接著又以同樣論述指稱，洋流是「狼披羊衣」，國民黨的主持人不要再邀沈伯洋接\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/newtalk.tw/481076a8e53746efe04109258d996c3e.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3CB8EF38AD4635EC7A420BB55ADB6B9175AA5B4DBCC835B3948CE192610DE701/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F481076a8e53746efe04109258d996c3e.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/61E727CDD247C229D0ABFC4B957637D7F5B7D07B983023340BFDA7767F3E1EC7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F481076a8e53746efe04109258d996c3e.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"認了「蔣萬安有可能落選」沈富雄：很像要日落西山了、夕陽了 你知道嗎？\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"3020e32c-1359-3060-ad06-eab058e15fd3\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%8D%E6%A7%93%E8%B6%99%E5%B0%91%E5%BA%B7%E5%81%9A%E7%90%83%E7%B5%A6%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E6%B2%88%E5%AF%8C%E9%9B%84%E9%A9%9A%E5%90%90-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%90%BD%E9%81%B8-%E6%97%A5%E8%90%BD%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%86-211200342.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":63},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%8D%E6%A7%93%E8%B6%99%E5%B0%91%E5%BA%B7%E5%81%9A%E7%90%83%E7%B5%A6%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E6%B2%88%E5%AF%8C%E9%9B%84%E9%A9%9A%E5%90%90-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%90%BD%E9%81%B8-%E6%97%A5%E8%90%BD%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%86-211200342.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"749a41b0-8dbb-35cf-95d1-297edfec32d6\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"才槓趙少康做球給沈伯洋！沈富雄驚吐「蔣萬安可能落選」：日落西山了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T21:12:00Z\",\"summary\":\"選戰倒數，民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋車掃展現高人氣，引發政壇高度關注。前立委沈富雄日前示警直言現任市長蔣萬安「有可能落選」，形容其選情如同日落西山，並呼籲藍營主持人切勿再邀訪幫對手造勢。對於盧秀燕將出任蔣萬安競選總部主委，沈富雄認為這是危機中的急救。此言論引發網友熱議，外界解讀沈富雄此舉意在催化藍營危機感，藉此激發基本盤投票率，為選情增添變數。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/810cad543c39b0b25b22fba0bd3e7d7f.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/54595DECEEFC52594C7BC49EBA48194BF2A8CB41F20CF0745D2D22097A459FA8/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F810cad543c39b0b25b22fba0bd3e7d7f.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/142622A11F0745D79C150B165BF1FFFB3F663FC0FBC4DD51F0D80958DA0BF1A6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F810cad543c39b0b25b22fba0bd3e7d7f.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"才槓趙少康做球給沈伯洋！沈富雄驚吐「蔣萬安可能落選」：日落西山了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"749a41b0-8dbb-35cf-95d1-297edfec32d6\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%81%AD%E5%BE%90%E5%B7%A7%E8%8A%AF%E5%97%86-%E6%88%91%E5%80%91%E6%9C%83%E8%B4%8F-%E7%9A%84%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%AD%B8%E5%BC%9F%E6%A5%8A%E7%9B%9B%E5%AE%89%E7%99%BC%E9%95%B7%E6%96%87%E8%AB%87%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%90%8C%E5%9C%A8%E6%B0%B8%E5%90%89%E8%B7%AF%E9%95%B7%E5%A4%A7-%E4%BB%96%E5%BE%9E%E4%BE%86%E6%B2%92%E6%9C%89%E9%9B%A2%E9%96%8B%E9%81%8E%E4%BA%94%E5%88%86%E5%9F%94-222920751.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":34},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%81%AD%E5%BE%90%E5%B7%A7%E8%8A%AF%E5%97%86-%E6%88%91%E5%80%91%E6%9C%83%E8%B4%8F-%E7%9A%84%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%AD%B8%E5%BC%9F%E6%A5%8A%E7%9B%9B%E5%AE%89%E7%99%BC%E9%95%B7%E6%96%87%E8%AB%87%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%90%8C%E5%9C%A8%E6%B0%B8%E5%90%89%E8%B7%AF%E9%95%B7%E5%A4%A7-%E4%BB%96%E5%BE%9E%E4%BE%86%E6%B2%92%E6%9C%89%E9%9B%A2%E9%96%8B%E9%81%8E%E4%BA%94%E5%88%86%E5%9F%94-222920751.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"99d3e6a9-804c-3693-8619-a85e8636fb3f\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"放言 Fount Media\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T22:29:20Z\",\"summary\":\"「他從來沒有離開過五分埔。」10月18日上午，帶著兩個兒子的楊盛安，當面向台北市長蔣萬安表明自己是學弟，但這次支持沈伯洋，一旁的國民黨立委徐巧芯隨即接話「我們還是會贏」。楊盛安隨後在臉書發表長文，分享支持沈伯洋的原因：兩人同在永吉路一帶長大，看到沈伯洋走訪社區，細數水果攤、麵線與油飯店，熟悉的街坊記憶讓他感受到，即使沈伯洋赴美求學、搬家、當上立委，始終沒有離開成長的地方。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/fountmedia_io_269/cec6d4909d412e88779a45540b1c4210\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/990EBA1A56113BEDF715ADA8210BFFAA7410B56B92134841FBEA904A10445A08/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ffountmedia_io_269%2Fcec6d4909d412e88779a45540b1c4210\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E178B6A220C338C1B4B1A958BA6D204FEDA66A5136103DE644815545112E2BD7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ffountmedia_io_269%2Fcec6d4909d412e88779a45540b1c4210\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"99d3e6a9-804c-3693-8619-a85e8636fb3f\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%98%87%E5%A7%BF%E4%B8%B0%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E5%8A%A9%E9%99%A3%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E5%96%8A-%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%AC%8A%E8%B2%B4-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E9%80%99%E6%A8%A3%E5%9B%9E-030844105.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":14},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%98%87%E5%A7%BF%E4%B8%B0%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E5%8A%A9%E9%99%A3%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E5%96%8A-%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%AC%8A%E8%B2%B4-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E9%80%99%E6%A8%A3%E5%9B%9E-030844105.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"1f9205b1-78e6-3ce3-b1c2-329c6ad46751\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"蘇姿丰父親助陣沈伯洋喊「台北不需要權貴」 蔣萬安這樣回\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"自由時報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T03:08:44Z\",\"summary\":\"民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋昨（18日）晚在民生社區民權公園舉行市政開講，超微半導體（AMD）董事長蘇姿丰的父親蘇春槐回台助陣，他看好沈伯洋有能力帶領台北成為亞洲最偉大的城市，還說「台北市長並不需要權貴」暗指台北市長蔣萬安；蔣萬安今（19）日表示，「屬於我的標籤，我要怎麼撕，撕不掉，但不屬於我的標籤，\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/libertytimes_786/cf4efce6cebcccb985747a56a772f1ed.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F9F9ED6DEB889EEC4FF5372A753FACDD16AEFE37A805E4931C7053C068B80C75/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2Fcf4efce6cebcccb985747a56a772f1ed.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/AFA4D97F172E19A5350E2C723AD288C1C35E6C89315AFCA6FD1FF6F41C352248/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2Fcf4efce6cebcccb985747a56a772f1ed.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"蘇姿丰父親助陣沈伯洋喊「台北不需要權貴」 蔣萬安這樣回\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"1f9205b1-78e6-3ce3-b1c2-329c6ad46751\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B6%85%E9%81%8E3%E8%90%AC%E4%BA%BA%E6%93%A0%E7%88%86%E9%80%A0%E5%8B%A2%E6%9C%83%E5%A0%B4-%E5%BC%B5%E5%96%84%E6%94%BF%E5%BF%8D%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E9%96%8B%E8%BD%9F-%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E6%9C%89%E6%94%BF%E8%A6%8B%E5%97%8E-%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E6%90%97%E4%BA%82-135933091.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":84},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B6%85%E9%81%8E3%E8%90%AC%E4%BA%BA%E6%93%A0%E7%88%86%E9%80%A0%E5%8B%A2%E6%9C%83%E5%A0%B4-%E5%BC%B5%E5%96%84%E6%94%BF%E5%BF%8D%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E9%96%8B%E8%BD%9F-%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E6%9C%89%E6%94%BF%E8%A6%8B%E5%97%8E-%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E6%90%97%E4%BA%82-135933091.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"1184c3fa-beca-39a1-959a-7699a6f1fa5b\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中天新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-17T13:59:33Z\",\"summary\":\"桃園市長張善政今（17）日晚間舉辦大型造勢活動，藍白大咖齊聚相挺，現場更湧入3萬人。張善政表示，選舉時總會遭到抹黑，自己最近也被唱衰到差一點懷疑人生，「哪有唱衰自己城市市政建設的？桃園不是國民黨的、不是民進黨的，是大家的桃園！」\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/gotv_ctitv_com_tw_678/71bac70e1e42e3d19d03f7f6f5d85475.png\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6A79051EC4199F55495E3E372035824EAE1297EE033B44167A626D2646DFBA62/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F71bac70e1e42e3d19d03f7f6f5d85475.png\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3E28C1082F0AE061A8F90D0CE875FF4453C137E43237E2D440FA62B6918C5336/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F71bac70e1e42e3d19d03f7f6f5d85475.png\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"1184c3fa-beca-39a1-959a-7699a6f1fa5b\"}],\"recommendedArticlesPaginationCursor\":\"eyJzZXNzaW9uSWQiOiIyZmNkZjc5OC02MTZiLTQzNDUtOGRkNS1iMWE2ZGM3ODc1NzUiLCJpbmRleCI6MjB9\",\"shouldFetchPreferenceStream\":false,\"stockMarketTime\":[],\"stockUserLevel\":\"\",\"trendingStream\":[{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B%E6%9A%B4%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%B6%E6%A8%82%E7%A6%8F70%E5%BA%97%E8%A2%AB%E6%B4%97%E5%8A%AB-ceo%E4%BC%B0%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E9%9C%80-%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E6%AD%90%E5%85%83-%E6%80%92%E5%96%8A%E7%B5%95%E4%B8%8D%E5%A6%A5%E5%8D%94-023850270.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":10},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B%E6%9A%B4%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%B6%E6%A8%82%E7%A6%8F70%E5%BA%97%E8%A2%AB%E6%B4%97%E5%8A%AB-ceo%E4%BC%B0%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E9%9C%80-%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E6%AD%90%E5%85%83-%E6%80%92%E5%96%8A%E7%B5%95%E4%B8%8D%E5%A6%A5%E5%8D%94-023850270.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"aef33469-c490-3835-909b-be74b4e8f2ee\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"法國暴動家樂福70店被洗劫！CEO估維修需「千萬歐元」 怒喊絕不妥協\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"太報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T02:38:50Z\",\"summary\":\"法國基層近期因不滿教育資源不足、生活成本高漲，17日上午就有55萬人走上街頭抗議，但原本和平示威卻變調，不少人變暴民襲擊數百名警察，縱火燒古蹟，國際精品店愛馬仕、勞力士都被洗劫，而連零售巨頭家樂福（Carrefour）也有69間門市遭洗劫，商場被嚴重破壞、商品散落劫走，執行長邦帕德（Alexandre Bompard）預估總維修費高達1千萬歐元，呼籲國家應出面保護商家。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/fr/taisounds_com_380/fbfef3cb5925ee6ded19b44f0df369ff.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0C809048FFA57C097AC2C1862F1EFCE7AC1BB81F959D2DA6A55FCF4CDE2161BD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Ffr%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2Ffbfef3cb5925ee6ded19b44f0df369ff.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8DD788F9F714029652AFA6D97C32A789F9ED2CC0E2BC6E42D47A3EF05E2E18AB/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Ffr%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2Ffbfef3cb5925ee6ded19b44f0df369ff.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"法國暴動家樂福70店被洗劫！CEO估維修需「千萬歐元」 怒喊絕不妥協\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"aef33469-c490-3835-909b-be74b4e8f2ee\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%BD%E5%BF%83%E6%89%B6%E5%A9%A6%E6%8C%A8%E5%91%8A11%E8%90%AC%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3-%E6%80%95%E7%95%99%E5%89%8D%E7%A7%91-%E9%80%80%E4%BC%91%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E7%99%BC%E8%81%B2%E6%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98-031532933.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":107},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A5%BD%E5%BF%83%E6%89%B6%E5%A9%A6%E6%8C%A8%E5%91%8A11%E8%90%AC%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3-%E6%80%95%E7%95%99%E5%89%8D%E7%A7%91-%E9%80%80%E4%BC%91%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88%E7%99%BC%E8%81%B2%E6%8C%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98-031532933.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"0bbd952b-fdff-3435-bad8-bb444fc44c7d\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"北捷扶婦挨告11萬和解「怕留前科」　退休教授發聲挺法官\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中天新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T03:15:32Z\",\"summary\":\"北市一名劉姓退休教授因在捷運站攙扶跌倒婦人挨告，雙方在法官建議下以11萬元達成和解。劉姓教授發聲透露，自己是獨居老人、全家族30多人無前科，深怕因此留下紀錄，且不願將剩餘時光耗費於漫長訴訟，也期盼外界不要誤解處事公正的承審法官。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/gotv_ctitv_com_tw_678/72ee644a40cd915ae32f7c9b98f9934f.png\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/60DAE75C68008A97768B56DD821E130CF49D369E914D4D1F7CE4D7C93D158419/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F72ee644a40cd915ae32f7c9b98f9934f.png\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5F873A9EFE7FAA0DD046D2150BF2B48713DB1F2ED7D72448B809EFD6FF5BCCC4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F72ee644a40cd915ae32f7c9b98f9934f.png\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"北捷扶婦挨告11萬和解「怕留前科」　退休教授發聲挺法官\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"0bbd952b-fdff-3435-bad8-bb444fc44c7d\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B7%AA%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%98%BF%E5%AC%A4%E6%98%AF%E8%87%A8%E6%BC%94-%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%B6%E6%9B%9D%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%BA%AB%E5%88%86-6%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8A%E8%A1%97%E4%BA%86-232805920.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":358},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B7%AA%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%98%BF%E5%AC%A4%E6%98%AF%E8%87%A8%E6%BC%94-%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%B6%E6%9B%9D%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%BA%AB%E5%88%86-6%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8A%E8%A1%97%E4%BA%86-232805920.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"0fb2dac5-d08b-39ae-8c23-74088a4ec958\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"跪沈伯洋的阿嬤是臨演？作家曝真實身分：6年前就上街了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中時新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:28:05Z\",\"summary\":\"民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋17日前往社子島參加活動，一名阿嬤突然下跪陳情，哭求沈伯洋當選後協助當地居民，未料畫面曝光後，卻遭部分網友質疑是事先安排的「臨時演員」，引發議論。對此，作家「漂浪島嶼」18日發文揭露，這名洪姓阿嬤早在6年前、蔣萬安尚未當選台北市長時，就已跟隨反徵收自救會上街抗爭，並非所謂的臨演。他更感嘆，為了保住家園，「別說下跪陳情，趴在地上都是願意」，但也直言，無論蔣萬安或沈伯洋，都未真正回應居民反對徵收的核心訴求。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/chinatimes.com.tw/951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B77B358A9F73C175FBC7952EEB7A111AF994DDCD4C7052CFD3F26561293033CE/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fchinatimes.com.tw%2F951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A1411F833B0274B2A01E4092BD357989D92B679453561E9E5CB434AF4855A746/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fchinatimes.com.tw%2F951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"跪沈伯洋的阿嬤是臨演？作家曝真實身分：6年前就上街了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"0fb2dac5-d08b-39ae-8c23-74088a4ec958\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A6%AC%E7%A5%96%E7%A2%BC%E9%A0%AD%E9%A9%9A%E7%88%86%E5%A5%AA%E5%91%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%AE%89-3%E5%B7%A5%E4%BA%BA%E9%9B%A2%E5%A5%87%E5%96%AA%E5%91%BD-%E6%89%BF%E5%8C%85%E5%95%86%E9%81%AD%E7%A9%B6%E8%B2%AC-021644886.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":50},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A6%AC%E7%A5%96%E7%A2%BC%E9%A0%AD%E9%A9%9A%E7%88%86%E5%A5%AA%E5%91%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%AE%89-3%E5%B7%A5%E4%BA%BA%E9%9B%A2%E5%A5%87%E5%96%AA%E5%91%BD-%E6%89%BF%E5%8C%85%E5%95%86%E9%81%AD%E7%A9%B6%E8%B2%AC-021644886.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"784a331b-f82f-3610-95f2-90a427d3bc16\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"馬祖碼頭驚爆奪命工安！3工人離奇喪命　承包商遭究責\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"CTWANT\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T02:16:44Z\",\"summary\":\"據了解，事發當時3名工人正在浮動平台內部作業，由於施工環境空間狹小，疑似發生缺氧或有害氣體蓄積情形，導致3人接連倒下，連江縣衛生局長陳美金表示，接獲通報後立即協調東、西莒共3名醫師投入急救，無奈仍無法挽回3條寶貴生命，確切死因有待檢方相驗釐清。事故發生後，連...\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ctwant_com_582/083660f303d7491224051b86b9391984.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/EFFA46B7D0A04F017014D1BD14D294DAE922028F8F2EE3D54D694A81307B2E0D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fctwant_com_582%2F083660f303d7491224051b86b9391984.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3559C4840C689C7C1ED4B441A3673FB16CB52B37E3B22F9E8499A927E675A9BF/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fctwant_com_582%2F083660f303d7491224051b86b9391984.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"馬祖碼頭驚爆奪命工安！3工人離奇喪命　承包商遭究責\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"784a331b-f82f-3610-95f2-90a427d3bc16\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%B6%E8%B7%8C%E5%80%92%E5%A9%A6%E5%8F%8D%E6%8C%A8%E5%91%8A-11%E8%90%AC%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3-%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E9%81%AD%E7%B6%B2%E7%8B%82%E8%BD%9F-%E7%95%B6%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E9%9D%A2%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%8D-%E5%B0%88%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%94%E6%BA%AB%E6%9A%96-010754455.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":187},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%89%B6%E8%B7%8C%E5%80%92%E5%A9%A6%E5%8F%8D%E6%8C%A8%E5%91%8A-11%E8%90%AC%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3-%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E9%81%AD%E7%B6%B2%E7%8B%82%E8%BD%9F-%E7%95%B6%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%BA%E5%87%BA%E9%9D%A2%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%8D-%E5%B0%88%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%94%E6%BA%AB%E6%9A%96-010754455.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"cca04477-846c-3ce2-898a-1d83fdc545c7\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"「扶跌倒婦反挨告」11萬和解！法官遭網狂轟　當事人出面平反：專業且溫暖\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"太報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T01:07:54Z\",\"summary\":\"台北市一名劉姓退休教授先前在捷運忠孝復興站見到一名婦人跌倒，上前攙扶未果，後續竟反遭對方提告，還被檢方依過失傷害罪起訴，對劉翁造成沉重打擊。近日台北地院開庭，法官宋恩同以親身經歷，勸說劉翁繼續相信「行善的價值」，雙方以11萬元達成和解，未料卻有不少網友誤會成「法官判賠11萬元」，紛紛抨擊法官。對此，劉翁出面喊話，宋恩同是專業、通情達理的法官，11萬元和解是他自己所接受、並非法官下的判決，希望網友不要再盲目攻擊法官。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/taisounds_com_380/7f7bf84b5993fa9bdb20188d3b94bb93.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CA7A59C4C3C5D2E61940511C1842769DB0AF385E76648005547673F61CD7C05F/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F7f7bf84b5993fa9bdb20188d3b94bb93.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D871EC06221664123C1FBF3932BD4808415E33A2BC1337D4967EE53623308CD3/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F7f7bf84b5993fa9bdb20188d3b94bb93.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"「扶跌倒婦反挨告」11萬和解！法官遭網狂轟　當事人出面平反：專業且溫暖\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"cca04477-846c-3ce2-898a-1d83fdc545c7\"}]}],\"\"]}]\n"])</script></body></html>